ANTARMSG.LBX     42  00004      88  en            We have come to erradicate all life forms from this galaxy. You cannot stand against us.
ANTARMSG.LBX     43  00004     119  en            This galaxy will be cleansed of all inferior life forms. And indeed, all beings are inferior to the beautiful Antarans!
ANTARMSG.LBX     44  00004      61  en            We have returned to continue our purification of this galaxy.
ANTARMSG.LBX     45  00004     121  en            You continue to stand in the way of the Antaran Empire. You may not surrender, you cannot win, your only option is death.
ANTARMSG.LBX     46  00004      85  en            It is again your turn to be crushed beneath the great force that is the Antaran army.
ANTARMSG.LBX     47  00004     131  en            All your petty squabbling with the other beings in this galaxy are meaningless. The Antaran fleet will destroy you all, one by one.
