COUNCMSG.LBX      0  00004      41  en            You are the one true ruler of the galaxy!
COUNCMSG.LBX      1  00004      63  en            You are truly the greatest leader in the history of the galaxy.
COUNCMSG.LBX      2  00004      72  en            You have earned your place in history as the best leader there ever was.
COUNCMSG.LBX      3  00004      80  en            We are overjoyed to join in the United Galactic Republic with you as our leader.
COUNCMSG.LBX      4  00004      81  en            You have proven that you are the Chosen One. We happily accept you as our leader!
COUNCMSG.LBX      5  00004      58  en            Long live the new Emperor of the United Galactic Republic!
COUNCMSG.LBX      6  00004      67  en            You are the greatest Emperor ever. We are honored to join with you.
COUNCMSG.LBX      7  00004      58  en            With you as our leader, all is well in the galaxy tonight!
COUNCMSG.LBX      8  00004      70  en            You are the most glorious, honorable, and wise Emperor there ever was!
COUNCMSG.LBX      9  00004      68  en            We will follow wherever you may lead, oh great and glorious Emperor!
COUNCMSG.LBX     10  00004      91  en            There has never been another such as you. You the wisest Emperor this galaxy has ever seen!
COUNCMSG.LBX     11  00004      53  en            The galaxy is lucky to have a leader as great as you!
COUNCMSG.LBX     12  00004      75  en            The galaxy stands united behind you, the most glorious Emperor of all time.
COUNCMSG.LBX     13  00004      57  en            All hail the new Emperor of the United Galactic Republic!
COUNCMSG.LBX     14  00004      50  de            lhr seid der einzige, wahre Herrscher der Galaxie!
COUNCMSG.LBX     15  00004      71  de            lhr seid wahrlich der herrlichste F#hrer in der Geschichte der Galaxie.
COUNCMSG.LBX     16  00004      94  de            lhr habt Euch Euren Platz in der Geschichte als den besten F#hrer, den es jemals gab, verdient
COUNCMSG.LBX     17  00004     102  de            Wir sind #bergl#cklich, der Vereinigten Galaktischen Republik mit Euch als unseren F#hrer beizutreten.
COUNCMSG.LBX     18  00004     106  de            Ihr habt bewiesen, da| lhr der Auserw[hlte seid. Wir sind gl#cklich, Euch als unseren F#hrer anzuerkennen!
COUNCMSG.LBX     19  00004      64  de            Lang lebe der neue Kaiser der Vereinigten Galaktischen Republik!
COUNCMSG.LBX     20  00004      77  de            lhr seid der gr}|te Kaiser aller Zeiten. Es ehrt uns, mit Euch zu vereinigen.
COUNCMSG.LBX     21  00004      68  de            Mit Euch als unscr F#hrer ist heute abend alles wohl in der Galaxie!
COUNCMSG.LBX     22  00004      79  de            Ihr seid der pr[chtigste, ehrenhafteste und weiseste Kaiser, den es jemals gab!
COUNCMSG.LBX     23  00004      74  de            Wir werden Euch #berall hin folgen, oh, gro|artiger und pr[chtiger Kaiser!
COUNCMSG.LBX     24  00004     103  de            Es hat nie jemand wie Euch gegeben. Ihr seid der weiseste Kaiser, den diese Galaxie jemals gesehen hat!
COUNCMSG.LBX     25  00004      80  de            Die Galaxie kann von Gl#ck sagen, einen so gro|artigen F#hrer wie Euch zu haben!
COUNCMSG.LBX     26  00004      77  de            Die Galaxie steht vereinigt hinter Euch, dem pr[chtigsten Kaiser aller Zeiten
COUNCMSG.LBX     27  00004      69  de            Alle begr#|en den neuen Kaiser der Vereinigten Galaktischen Republik!
COUNCMSG.LBX     29  00004      70  fr            Vous =tes le plus grand dirigeant dans toute l'histoire de la galaxie.
COUNCMSG.LBX     30  00004      73  fr            Vous vous =tes affirm# comme le plus grand dirigeant de toute l'histoire.
COUNCMSG.LBX     31  00004      85  fr            Nous sommes fiers de rejoindre la R#publique galactique unifi#e sous votre direction.
COUNCMSG.LBX     32  00004      86  fr            Vous avez prouv# que vous #tiez l'Elu. Nous sommes fiers de vous placer & notre t=te !
COUNCMSG.LBX     33  00004      61  fr            Vive le nouvel Empereur de la R#publique galactique unifi#e !
COUNCMSG.LBX     34  00004      74  fr            Vous =tes le plus grand de tous les Empereurs. C'est un honneur pour nous.
COUNCMSG.LBX     35  00004      57  fr            Sous votre direction, la galaxie est en de bonnes mains !
COUNCMSG.LBX     36  00004      91  fr            Vous surpassez tous les autres Empereurs par votre gloire, votre sagesse et votre probit# !
COUNCMSG.LBX     37  00004      59  fr            Nous vous suivrons fid>lement, oh notre glorieux Empereur !
COUNCMSG.LBX     38  00004      92  fr            Personne ne peut rivaliser avec vous, l'Empereur le plus avis# que cette galaxie ait connu !
COUNCMSG.LBX     39  00004      49  fr            Nous sommes heureux de vous savoir & notre t=te !
COUNCMSG.LBX     40  00004      77  fr            Notre galaxie vous suivra, vous, le plus illustre Empereur de tous les temps.
COUNCMSG.LBX     41  00004      66  fr            Acclamons le nouvel Empereur de la R#publique galactique unifi#e !
COUNCMSG.LBX     42  00004      46  fr            #Eres el `nico y verdadero amo de la galaxia!,
COUNCMSG.LBX     43  00004      67  fr            Eres, sin duda, el l{der m<s poderoso en la historia de la galaxia.
COUNCMSG.LBX     44  00004      76  es            Te has ganado un lugar en la historia como el mejor l{der que haya existido.
COUNCMSG.LBX     46  00004      77  es            Has dado muestras de ser el Elegido.#Gozosos te aceptamos como nuestro l{der!
COUNCMSG.LBX     48  00004      62  es            Eres el m<s grande los Emperadores. Nos honra estar a tu lado.
COUNCMSG.LBX     49  00004      64  ?             Contigo como l{der, nada hay que temer en la galaxia esta noche!
COUNCMSG.LBX     50  00004      68  es            Eres el Emperador m<s glorioso, honorable y sabio que haya existido!
COUNCMSG.LBX     51  00004      71  ?             Te seguiremos donde quiera que nos conduzcas, #oh, magn<nimo Emperador!
COUNCMSG.LBX     52  00004      85  es            No ha existido nadie como t`. Eres el Emperador m<s sabido que la galaxia haya visto!
COUNCMSG.LBX     54  00004      89  es            La galaxia es indivisible bajo tu manto,#oh, tu el m<s glorioso Emperador de los tiempos!
COUNCMSG.LBX     56  00004      50  it            Sei l'unico vero grande dominatore della galassia!
COUNCMSG.LBX     57  00004      67  it            Sei proprio il pi} grande stratega nella storia di questa galassia.
COUNCMSG.LBX     58  00004      71  it            Ti sei guadagnato il titolo di miglior imperatore mai esistito. Evviva!
COUNCMSG.LBX     59  00004      73  it            Siamo felicissimi di entrare nella Nuova Repubblica sotto il tuo comando.
COUNCMSG.LBX     60  00004      90  it            Hai dimostrato di essere il pi} grande. Ti accettiamo con gioia come governatore assoluto!
COUNCMSG.LBX     61  00004      57  it            Lunga vita all'imperatore supremo della Nuova Repubblica!
COUNCMSG.LBX     62  00004      69  it            Sei il pi} grande imperatore mai esistito. Siamo onorati di servirti.
COUNCMSG.LBX     63  00004      74  ?             Con un imperatore come te, pi} niente in questa galassia potr& andar male!
COUNCMSG.LBX     64  00004      64  it            Sei il pi} glorioso, onorevole e saggio imperatore mai esistito!
COUNCMSG.LBX     65  00004      62  ?             O grande e glorioso imperatore, ti seguiremo dovunque tu vada!
COUNCMSG.LBX     66  00004      83  it            Non c'> mai stato nessun altro come te. Sei il pi} grande imperatore dell'universo.
COUNCMSG.LBX     67  00004      65  ?             L'intera galassia > fortunata, con un imperatore del tuo calibro.
COUNCMSG.LBX     68  00004      72  it            La galassia e i suoi abitanti sono tutti con te, o magnifico imperatore!
COUNCMSG.LBX     69  00004      78  it            Tutti ci inchiniamo e salutiamo il tuo nome, imperatore. Sei tre volte grande!
COUNCMSG.LBX     70  00004      41  en            You are the one true ruler of the galaxy!
COUNCMSG.LBX     71  00004      63  en            You are truly the greatest leader in the history of the galaxy.
COUNCMSG.LBX     72  00004      72  en            You have earned your place in history as the best leader there ever was.
COUNCMSG.LBX     73  00004      80  en            We are overjoyed to join in the United Galactic Republic with you as our leader.
COUNCMSG.LBX     74  00004      81  en            You have proven that you are the Chosen One. We happily accept you as our leader!
COUNCMSG.LBX     75  00004      58  en            Long live the new Emperor of the United Galactic Republic!
COUNCMSG.LBX     76  00004      67  en            You are the greatest Emperor ever. We are honored to join with you.
COUNCMSG.LBX     77  00004      58  en            With you as our leader, all is well in the galaxy tonight!
COUNCMSG.LBX     78  00004      70  en            You are the most glorious, honorable, and wise Emperor there ever was!
COUNCMSG.LBX     79  00004      68  en            We will follow wherever you may lead, oh great and glorious Emperor!
COUNCMSG.LBX     80  00004      91  en            There has never been another such as you. You the wisest Emperor this galaxy has ever seen!
COUNCMSG.LBX     81  00004      53  en            The galaxy is lucky to have a leader as great as you!
COUNCMSG.LBX     82  00004      75  en            The galaxy stands united behind you, the most glorious Emperor of all time.
COUNCMSG.LBX     83  00004      57  en            All hail the new Emperor of the United Galactic Republic!
