diplomse.lbx      1  00005     123  en            \x0AYou are destined to fail, \x80. It is the law of evolution: the weak species will die, and only the strong will remain.
diplomse.lbx      1  000CE     105  en            Your presence makes me ill, Emperor \x80. Nothing you say is of any consequence to the great \x82 Empire.
diplomse.lbx      1  00196     114  en            Keep your worthless ships out of \x82 space, foolish \x80. We will not tolerate any trouble from you or your kind.
diplomse.lbx      1  0025E      97  en            The entire \x81 race will kneel before the mighty \x82 Empire, \x80. It is only a matter of time.
diplomse.lbx      1  00326     124  en            The only thing worse than \x84 \x81 citizen is \x84 \x81 Emperor. Your defeat will be swift but your death slow and painful.
diplomse.lbx      1  003EE      77  en            The \x81 people are as weak as they are ugly.  We will destroy you all, \x80.
diplomse.lbx      1  004B6      98  en            Your people are only fit as slaves to the noble \x82 Empire. Your utter destruction is inevitable.
diplomse.lbx      1  0057E     127  en            Death to the \x81 race! First, we'll destroy your ships. Then, we'll destroy your planets. We will not rest until you are gone!
diplomse.lbx      1  00646     120  en            Seeing you defeated will not be enough. It is your death, and the extinction of your entire race that I look forward to!
diplomse.lbx      1  0070E     111  en            Your mere presence makes my skin crawl with revulsion, \x80. Be gone from \x82 space, or you will be destroyed.
diplomse.lbx      2  00006      79  en            Your empire is pathetic, \x80. I will personally see to your utter destruction.
diplomse.lbx      2  000CE      92  en            Emperor \x80 be warned: the \x82 Empire has arrived to free the galaxy from the \x81 terror.
diplomse.lbx      2  00196      74  en            The \x82 Empire will crush you utterly, \x80. Do not attempt to resist us.
diplomse.lbx      2  0025E     120  en            Do not attempt to stand in the way of \x82 mastery, foolish \x81. We will rule the galaxy; you are powerless to stop us!
diplomse.lbx      2  00326     108  en            Fear me, \x80, for I speak for the mighty \x82 Empire: we will destroy you and all those who stand with you!
diplomse.lbx      2  003EE      97  en            You cannot succeed in your feeble attempts at mastery, \x80. The \x82 Empire will always prevail!
diplomse.lbx      2  004B6      95  en            The mighty \x82 Empire has a unified goal, Emperor \x80: to erase your empire from this galaxy!
diplomse.lbx      2  0057E      94  en            Your destruction is inevitable, foolish \x81.  The \x82 Empire is destined to rule the galaxy!
diplomse.lbx      3  00005     134  en            \x09Greetings, Emperor \x80! I am glad to finally meet you in person, it will make watching your destruction so much more pleasurable.
diplomse.lbx      3  000CE     161  en            I hope that your race will last long enough to give my people a little sport, \x80. Like a cat with a mouse, we enjoy playing with our prey before destroying it.
diplomse.lbx      3  00196     124  en            Fear not, Emperor \x80. After your defeat, your people will be welcomed into the \x82 kingdom as the worthy slaves they are.
diplomse.lbx      3  0025E      98  en            Pray to whatever gods motivate you, \x80. We are coming for your ships, your planets, your people.
diplomse.lbx      3  00326      60  en            I see that the competition has arrived. Let the games begin!
diplomse.lbx      3  003EE     113  en            So you are what passes for an emperor in the \x81 kingdom. You are truly much more pathetic than I ever imagined.
diplomse.lbx      3  004B6     127  en            The glorious \x82 Empire is here to dethrone you, \x80. But don't worry, Emperor \x83 will let you live on as a personal slave.
diplomse.lbx      3  0057E     100  en            A fine empire you have built, Emperor \x80. It will be a worthy addition to the mighty \x82 kingdom!
diplomse.lbx      3  00646     150  en            Please do not surrender, dear \x80. The \x82 military is anxious to meet you in battle; the odds-makers are even giving you a 10% chance of surviving!
diplomse.lbx      4  00006      66  en            Keep your distance \x81 emperor. We will tolerate no interference.
diplomse.lbx      4  000CE     114  en            Do not provoke the \x82 Empire, \x80. We will attack if you remain too close to territory that is rightfully ours.
diplomse.lbx      4  00196     122  en            I see that the \x81 race is attempting expansion. Just don't look to expand into \x82 space, or we will attack with force.
diplomse.lbx      4  0025E     137  en            I must admit, now that I've met you I like the \x81 race even less. Stay away from the \x82 Empire, it's business is no concern of yours.
diplomse.lbx      4  00326     138  en            I am not interested in what you have to say, \x80, your aggressive actions speak for themselves. Just stay away, or you will be destroyed!
diplomse.lbx      4  003EE      83  en            Learn to be content with what you have, Emperor \x80. You will get nothing from us.
diplomse.lbx      4  004B6      90  en            We are watching your moves closely, \x81 emperor. Any aggressive acts will be met in kind.
diplomse.lbx      4  0057E     107  en            I am warning you, \x80 of the \x81 Empire: your presence is not welcome. Keep your ships out of \x82 space.
diplomse.lbx      5  00005     101  en            \x09Greetings, Emperor \x80. The \x82 people pray for peace between us and the honorable \x81 people.
diplomse.lbx      5  000CE     119  en            The galaxy offers a great many treasures, Emperor \x80. It is our hope that we can share this vast wealth of resources.
diplomse.lbx      5  00196     156  en            There is always tension when two empires first meet, Emperor \x80. Let us do our best to allay those fears, and work towards an age of peace and prosperity.
diplomse.lbx      5  0025E     132  en            The \x82 Empire delights in this first contact between our races, Emperor \x80, and looks forward to profitable dealings between us.
diplomse.lbx      5  00326     111  en            We have heard many things about the great \x81 Empire. We hope you will come to trust us as allies and friends.
diplomse.lbx      5  003EE     128  en            I believe that both our races will benefit from a policy of cooperation, Emperor \x80. Let us work towards peaceful coexistence.
diplomse.lbx      5  004B6     151  en            It is easy to see why the \x81 people have chosen you to lead them, wise and honorable \x80. We welcome the chance to trade, share, and learn from you.
diplomse.lbx      5  0057E      90  en            We will deal fairly with you, Emperor \x80, as long as you show us the same consideration.
diplomse.lbx      5  00646      93  en            The year \x8E will go down in history as the first time we encountered the great \x81 Empire!
diplomse.lbx      6  00005      99  en            \x0AI greet you on behalf of the \x82 Empire, mighty \x80. May our people live together in harmony.
diplomse.lbx      6  000CE     125  en            The \x82 people are a quiet and peaceful race, your majesty. We look forward to a harmonious coexistence with the noble \x81.
diplomse.lbx      6  00196      91  en            Hail Emperor \x80! I come to you in the spirit of brotherhood to welcome you to \x82 space.
diplomse.lbx      6  0025E     115  en            Let there be no blood shed on this glorious and beautiful day, the first meeting between the \x81 and \x82 Empires!
diplomse.lbx      6  00326     147  en            The gods have smiled down on us, to give us the opportunity to forge a lasting bond between the \x82 people and your glorious empire, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx      6  003EE      87  en            It is our intention to pursue a peaceful relationship between our people, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx      6  004B6      85  en            The peaceful \x82 people welcome the chance to live side by side the honorable \x81s.
diplomse.lbx      6  0057E     114  en            There is plenty here for all, Emperor \x80. A lasting policy of friendship will serve to benefit both our empires.
diplomse.lbx      6  00646     145  en            The \x82 people feel no fear seeing glorious \x81 ships speed through our night skies. We know that you will honor us with peace and brotherhood.
diplomse.lbx      6  0070E     131  en            No purpose would be served by anger or mistrust between us, Emperor \x80. Our empires can both grow to prosper in this wide galaxy.
diplomse.lbx      7  00006      61  en            The \x82 Empire honors you with its presence yet again, \x80.
diplomse.lbx      7  000CE      64  en            The great Emperor \x83 acknowledges your existence, \x81 leader.
diplomse.lbx      8  00006      68  en            It is a pleasure to re-establish contact with the \x81 Empire, \x80.
diplomse.lbx      8  000CE      95  en            It is \x8E, and we are ready to open the lines of communication between our empires once again.
diplomse.lbx      9  00006     119  en            The \x82 Empire is surprised to find you are still around, Emperor \x80. Perhaps you are not as pathetic as we thought.
diplomse.lbx      9  000CE      57  en            Again we meet, \x80. The pleasure is all yours, I'm sure.
diplomse.lbx     10  00006     107  en            Mighty \x83, Emperor of the \x82 people, sends greetings now that the lines of communication have reopened.
diplomse.lbx     10  000CE      82  en            Don't think we've forgotten about you, \x80. We're still watching your every move.
diplomse.lbx     10  00196      84  en            Greetings once again, \x80. Perhaps renewed contact between us will benefit us both.
diplomse.lbx     11  00006     107  en            Our relationship has been somewhat strained, \x80, but I assure you, Emperor \x83 holds you in high regard.
diplomse.lbx     11  000CE      92  en            I am at your service, Emperor \x80. Please do not hesitate to call should you need anything.
diplomse.lbx     12  00006     114  en            Just a friendly reminder: as ambassador to the \x82 people, I am here to assist you if I can, mighty Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx     12  000CE     111  en            Hail, kind \x80. The fellowship between our two peoples lives on now that we can communicate freely once again.
diplomse.lbx     12  00196      93  en            I am pleased to report that your popularity runs high in the \x82 nation, great Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx     13  00006     146  en            I shudder each time you come before me, \x80. Too bad communication is possible again, as time has not lessened my revulsion of you and your kind.
diplomse.lbx     14  00006     101  en            I have warned you that we will tolerate no interference. Your continued presence is an affront to me.
diplomse.lbx     14  000CE     127  en            I remind you now that we have contact again: the wrath of the \x82 Empire is terrible, \x80. Keep that in mind in our dealings.
diplomse.lbx     14  00196     124  en            I would just as soon kill you as speak to you, \x81 scum, but the mighty \x82 Emperor commands that I reopen communications.
diplomse.lbx     15  00006     186  en            Now that the lines of communication are open again, I can at last deliver this message: it is time for you to consider the merits of surrendering to the \x82 Empire before it's too late.
diplomse.lbx     15  000CE     117  en            Emperor \x83 is hereby reopening diplomatic channels. But don't get your hopes up, for we still hate the \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx     16  00006      99  en            Again we meet. The time that passed since we had communication was blissful, too bad it had to end.
diplomse.lbx     16  000CE      92  en            Have we met before? It matters not, I still bear the same message from Emperor \x83: beware!
diplomse.lbx     17  00006      94  en            Tensions run high, \x80. Pay close attention to your diplomatic duties in times such as these.
diplomse.lbx     17  000CE     141  en            Although we lost contact, we know your dealings have been less than honorable, Emperor \x80. Will your words be more than lies in the future?
diplomse.lbx     17  00196     143  en            The \x82 Empire is not pleased with you, \x80. It may be too late to heal the wounds between us, even though diplomatic channels have reopened.
diplomse.lbx     18  00006     126  en            It saddens me that in the time that passed since we could talk, the relations between us have grown so strained, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx     18  000CE     177  en            Now that contact has been re-established, I must give you a friendly reminder, Emperor \x80. My people prefer peace, \x80, but we are not afraid to fight for what we believe in.
diplomse.lbx     19  00006      59  en            Withdraw your spies at once, or deal with the consequences!
diplomse.lbx     19  000CE     117  en            Emperor \x83 demands an immediate halt to all \x81 covert activities in \x82 territory. Disobey, and war will follow.
diplomse.lbx     19  00196     115  en            Your espionage is jeopardizing our already weak relationship, \x80. Persist and we may be thrust into unwanted war.
diplomse.lbx     19  0025E     106  en            You show your true colors by sending your evil spies to steal our technology. Cease, or we will be at war.
diplomse.lbx     19  00326     150  en            The \x81 have always had a reputation for dishonorable dealing. I can see that reputation is deserved.  Withdraw your spies, fool, or war will result.
diplomse.lbx     19  003EE     169  en            We offer you our friendship, and you respond with underhanded espionage? You have wounded us deeply, \x80. We will be forced to go to war if you do not remove all spies.
diplomse.lbx     19  004B6     116  en            We know what you are up to, Emperor \x80. Get your \x81 spies out of \x82 space, or the price you pay will be great.
diplomse.lbx     20  00006      31  ?             MESSAGE THREAT ESPIONAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     21  00006      81  en            If you attempt to sabotage any more of our \x8D we will be forced to declare war.
diplomse.lbx     21  000CE     103  en            You are testing our patience, \x80. No more malicious sabotage of \x82 facilities or we will be at war.
diplomse.lbx     21  00196     102  en            If one more \x82 facility is destroyed by \x81 hands, you will find yourself with a war on your hands.
diplomse.lbx     21  0025E     133  en            Your sabotage of our \x8D wounds me, \x80. I thought we were better friends than that. Call off your saboteurs, or we will go to war.
diplomse.lbx     21  00326      71  en            Knock off the sabotage attacks, \x80, or the consequences will be dire.
diplomse.lbx     21  003EE     124  en            Our \x8D lie in ruin because of you, \x80. Cease this destruction, or your entire empire will reel from the blow we deliver.
diplomse.lbx     21  004B6      98  en            Sabotage is the act of a coward, \x80. If you want a war, just say so, we're ready to destroy you.
diplomse.lbx     21  0057E     158  en            We know you ordered the destruction of our \x8D. We warn you, Emperor \x83 will not hesitate to order the destruction of your empire if such attacks continue.
diplomse.lbx     22  00006      30  ?             MESSAGE THREAT SABOTAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     24  00006      96  en            Your use of biological weapons is sickening, \x80. If you continue their use, we will go to war.
diplomse.lbx     24  000CE     163  en            Never, never use such a deplorable device as that again, \x80. We will terminate all diplomatic relations and go to war with any race that uses biological weapons.
diplomse.lbx     24  00196     134  en            Biological weapons kill innocent children, \x80. We will not ally ourselves with baby killers - cease and desist or we will be at war!
diplomse.lbx     24  0025E     114  en            We do not approve of biological weaponry. If you use one again, we will systematically destroy your entire empire.
diplomse.lbx     24  00326     127  en            Emperor \x83 is disgusted by your immoral use of biological weapons. Don't do it again, \x80, or you will find yourself at war.
diplomse.lbx     24  003EE     132  en            The \x82 people mourn for the lives you so callously eradicated. Emperor \x83 warns you: no more bio-weaponry, or we will go to war!
diplomse.lbx     24  004B6     186  en            We can overlook one bio-weapons attack as the act of an overzealous military, \x80, but see to it that it never happens again, or we will step in and revenge the civilians you slaughter.
diplomse.lbx     24  0057E     163  en            We can scarcely believe that you would utilize such shocking bio-weaponry, \x80. It must never, never happen again, or the wrath  of the \x82 nation will be great.
diplomse.lbx     25  00006      69  en            Remove your blockade, Emperor \x80, or we will be forced to retaliate
diplomse.lbx     25  000CE     119  en            We do not appreciate the blockade you've imposed on our people, \x80. Disband it, or we will go to war to tear it down.
diplomse.lbx     25  00196     115  en            Please, do not make the \x82 people suffer any longer. Move your blockade and let peace come back into their lives.
diplomse.lbx     25  0025E      66  en            The \x81 ships blockading our system must be removed this instant!
diplomse.lbx     25  00326     131  en            If the blockade you have imposed upon us is not ended right now, the next message you have from the \x82 Empire will be one of war.
diplomse.lbx     25  003EE      49  en            Emperor \x83 commands you to remove the blockade.
diplomse.lbx     25  004B6     102  en            You will find that if you do not remove your blockade around the \x82 system, you will soon be at war.
diplomse.lbx     25  0057E     109  en            I bear a message from the great \x82 Emperor: cancel your blockade or we will declare war on the \x81 people.
diplomse.lbx     26  00006     132  en            Your economic expansion is getting out of hand, Emperor \x80. Slow down, or we will be forced to go to war to protect our interests.
diplomse.lbx     26  000CE     156  en            Don't be a power hungry fool, \x80. We will be forced to go to war with you if you continue to threaten our economic growth by hoarding money and resources.
diplomse.lbx     26  00196     115  en            You are grabbing economic power quickly and recklessly, \x80. Be careful, or your \x82 friends will become enemies.
diplomse.lbx     26  0025E     131  en            You are growing over ambitious, Emperor \x80. We warn you not to upset the balance of the galactic economy, or we will declare war.
diplomse.lbx     27  00006     196  en            So, trying to throw your weight around a little, eh? You think voting against us in the Council gains you a little attention? Rethink that strategy, or we may have to beat a little sense into you.
diplomse.lbx     27  000CE     146  en            If you are not for us, \x80, you are against us. We will not hesitate to destroy you if you continue to make yourself an enemy of the \x82 Empire.
diplomse.lbx     27  00196     190  en            Just a misunderstanding, yes? You meant to vote for the \x82 Emperor but made a mistake. We understand, and give you one more chance to correct your vote at the next meeting. Otherwise, war!
diplomse.lbx     27  0025E     175  en            The \x82 ruler needs your vote, \x80. Next time, vote for us, and you will see what valuable friends we can be. Vote against us, and you will see what dreaded enemies we make.
diplomse.lbx     27  00326     146  en            The \x82 Emperor is a little, shall we say, disappointed with your last vote, \x80. Don't displease us again, or there will be grave consequences.
diplomse.lbx     27  003EE     137  en            You voted incorrectly, \x80. You were supposed to vote for the \x82s, remember? Get it right next time, or you will find yourself at war.
diplomse.lbx     27  004B6     124  en            The \x82 Emperor is the only fit leader for the council. Next time, vote accordingly, or the price will be your destruction.
diplomse.lbx     29  00006      43  en            MESSAGE THREAT ESPIONAGE FRAMED WITH DEMAND
diplomse.lbx     31  00006      42  en            MESSAGE THREAT SABOTAGE FRAMED WITH DEMAND
diplomse.lbx     37  00006      87  en            You dare go against the wishes of the great Emperor \x83? You will pay dearly for this!
diplomse.lbx     37  000CE      61  en            Do not think that you can get away with this insolence, \x80!
diplomse.lbx     37  00196      49  en            You will pay for that decision, foolish \x81 dog!
diplomse.lbx     37  0025E      53  en            You will learn to regret that decision, Emperor \x80!
diplomse.lbx     38  00006      82  en            Emperor \x83 is pleased that you saw the light, \x80. You've made a wise decision.
diplomse.lbx     38  000CE      39  en            You are very wise indeed, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx     38  00196      78  en            We are happy to see that you are capable of such wise decisions, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx     39  00006     135  en            I cannot keep any treaties with someone that will go behind my back and steal technology! Our \x8A will be canceled if you do not stop.
diplomse.lbx     39  000CE     113  en            Let me make this simple for you, \x80 - remove your spies from our territory, or we will cancel the current \x8A.
diplomse.lbx     40  00006      37  ?             MESSAGE BREAK THREAT ESPIONAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     41  00006     118  en            Your sabotage attempts have strained our diplomatic relations, \x80. Be careful, or we may find cause to end our \x8A.
diplomse.lbx     41  000CE     110  en            We are aware of your petty sabotage attacks in our territory, \x80. Call them off, or we will cancel the \x8A.
diplomse.lbx     42  00006      36  ?             MESSAGE BREAK THREAT SABOTAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     43  0002F     116  en             system making us doubt your intentions to honor our \x8A. Be warned: we will break the treaty if they aren't moved.
diplomse.lbx     43  000F6      29  en             system jeopardizes our \x8A.
diplomse.lbx     44  00006     151  en            We have doubts about dealing with someone that would order the use of bio-weaponry.  We will break the current \x8A at the slightest provocation, \x80.
diplomse.lbx     44  000CE     136  en            Your deplorable use of biological weapons makes us doubt the value of the \x8A. Be warned - we will cancel it if you provoke us further.
diplomse.lbx     45  00006     170  en            We do not appreciate your placing a blockade around our star system, \x80. We suggest that you remove it, and do nothing further to provoke us, or we will break the \x8A.
diplomse.lbx     45  000CE      46  en            Remove your blockade or the \x8A is off, \x80.
diplomse.lbx     46  00006     118  en            I have a message from Emperor \x83: scale down your economic expansion and leave us alone, or we will cancel the \x8A.
diplomse.lbx     47  00006      97  en            Vote against Emperor \x83 again, and you will find that the \x8A with the \x82 has been canceled!
diplomse.lbx     49  00006      37  ?             MESSAGE BREAK TREATY ESPIONAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     51  00006      36  ?             MESSAGE BREAK TREATY SABOTAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     57  00006      70  en            Enough of your thievery, \x80 there is nothing but war between us now!
diplomse.lbx     57  000CE      80  en            You have not stolen enough \x82 technology to defend yourself against us in war!
diplomse.lbx     57  00196      78  en            Your attempts at espionage have lead to war, \x80. The blood is on your hands.
diplomse.lbx     57  0025E      73  ?             Enough games, \x80. No more petty spying and deceit, only full scale war!
diplomse.lbx     57  00326      76  en            Emperor \x83 has grown tired of your petty treachery. War has been declared!
diplomse.lbx     57  003EE     166  en            We are sick of your thievery, \x80. Just because your scientists are unimaginative, it doesn't give you the right to steal technology from ours. We have declared war.
diplomse.lbx     57  004B6      76  en            Your spies have taken their last \x82 technology, \x80. We will destroy you!
diplomse.lbx     57  0057E     169  en            I hope your spies stole enough technology to strengthen your military, \x80, because you are going to need all the help you can get against the might of the \x82 Empire!
diplomse.lbx     58  00006      36  ?             MESSAGE DECLARE WAR ESPIONAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     59  00006      74  en            You have destroyed your last \x82 facility. Emperor \x80, we stand at war!
diplomse.lbx     59  000CE      95  en            The blood spilled now will be \x81 blood, \x80, for you have sabotaged your last \x82 facility.
diplomse.lbx     59  00196     114  en            You leave us no choice. Your malicious sabotage of \x82 property has led mighty \x83 to call for your destruction.
diplomse.lbx     59  0025E     112  en            Sabotage is the act of a sneak and a coward, \x80. Come out in the open, and meet the \x82s in the field of war!
diplomse.lbx     59  00326     122  en            It will not be as easy to topple the \x82 Empire as it was to topple a few \x82 buildings. Come, try your best, \x81 scum!
diplomse.lbx     59  003EE     101  en            We will destroy more than just a few \x81 facilities, \x80. We will destroy your fleets and colonies!
diplomse.lbx     59  004B6      62  en            Emperor \x83 has declared war on the \x81 nation of saboteurs.
diplomse.lbx     60  00006      35  ?             MESSAGE DECLARE WAR SABOTAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     62  00006     155  en            Any empire willing to use biological weaponry must be eradicated from the galaxy. Prepare to defend yourselves, \x81 murders, \x82 ships are on the attack!
diplomse.lbx     62  000CE      94  en            Your use of such deplorable weapons is an affront the \x82 gods. We stand at war, \x81 coward.
diplomse.lbx     62  00196     127  en            You have mercilessly murdered hordes of innocents with your inhumane weapons. Now the \x82 Empire is poised to crush you, \x80!
diplomse.lbx     62  0025E     126  en            You have left no middle ground, \x80, only a place of rage, where your enemies line up against you on the left and right. War!
diplomse.lbx     62  00326     174  en            Your biological weapons killed innocent people, leaving behind a field of broken hearts and wasted lives. No more, \x80. You will answer for these atrocities with \x81 blood.
diplomse.lbx     63  00006     107  en            The \x82 people will suffer no more because of your blockade, Emperor \x80. We have entered a state of war.
diplomse.lbx     63  000CE     116  en            The \x82 people call for action, \x80, and the \x82 Emperor responds: to war with the enemy, the blockade will fall!
diplomse.lbx     63  00196     140  en            War, \x80, is not a pretty thing. But you've left us no choice, we can no longer lose face in front of the Council because of your blockade.
diplomse.lbx     63  0025E     165  en            Nothing was gained by your blockade of the \x82 system except fear and hatred. The \x82 Emperor has vowed to destroy you, \x80, there is nowhere for you to hide now.
diplomse.lbx     63  00326      76  en            Emperor \x83 declared war the minute you put your heinous blockade in place.
diplomse.lbx     63  003EE     100  en            We were waiting for an excuse to destroy you, \x81 oaf. Your absurd blockade is just what we needed.
diplomse.lbx     63  004B6      98  en            You will pay for your folly, \x80. First, we will destroy your blockade, then we will destroy you.
diplomse.lbx     64  00006     146  en            You have spent so long building your economy that you have neglected your military. The \x82 military will exploit your weaknesses, we are at war!
diplomse.lbx     64  000CE     174  en            You've grown too big a threat to the balance of economic power in this galaxy, \x80. Once we've blown your ships from the sky, you'll understand the importance of moderation.
diplomse.lbx     64  00196     154  en            The \x82 people are not afraid of you, \x80. You may have a full treasury, but we have more skill and courage, and we will beat you at every turn. To war!
diplomse.lbx     64  0025E     115  en            This ostentatious display of economic power of yours has no effect on the \x82s, \x80. We do not fear you - to war!
diplomse.lbx     64  00326      80  en            It is time the \x82 Empire stood against the tyranny of the bloated \x81 Empire!
diplomse.lbx     65  00006     155  en            We had counted on your vote in the Council, \x80 and now, we count on nothing more than your destruction. After all, the vote of the dead count for naught!
diplomse.lbx     65  000CE      80  en            The \x82 Emperor does not need your vote, \x81 scum, for we will have your head!
diplomse.lbx     65  00196     167  en            You made a grave mistake casting your vote against the glorious \x82 Empire. It is a mistake you will regret fully, as you watch your planets burn and your people die!
diplomse.lbx     65  0025E     177  en            You meant to vote for the \x82 Emperor, not against, didn't you? Well, history is made of such mistakes. Once we have eradicated the \x81 Empire, the historians can work it out.
diplomse.lbx     65  00326     104  en            The fight that began in the Council when you voted against us will be finished on the battlefield, \x80.
diplomse.lbx     65  003EE     138  en            We will either weaken you to the point that you will vote any way we like, or we will destroy you utterly. It really matters little to us!
diplomse.lbx     65  004B6      94  en            Emperor \x83 earned your vote, \x80. Now you have earned our wrath! The \x81 Empire must fall!
diplomse.lbx     65  0057E     129  en            Emperor \x83 sees no reason for the \x81 Empire to exist since you are so willing to throw your vote away. War has been declared.
diplomse.lbx     66  00006     105  en            You have dishonored the \x82 Nation, you \x81 clod. Now you must pay for your mistake on the battlefield.
diplomse.lbx     66  000CE      40  en            Your impetuous actions have lead to war!
diplomse.lbx     66  00196      98  en            You have discredited the great and wise Emperor \x83. We will extract our vengeance in \x81 blood.
diplomse.lbx     66  0025E     111  en            You have insulted the honorable Emperor \x83. Perhaps a short war will teach you to hold your impetuous tongue.
diplomse.lbx     66  00326      67  en            We have nothing but scorn for \x81 ruffians. War has been declared.
diplomse.lbx     67  00006     102  en            Emperor \x83 has authorized an attack on the \x81 Empire to celebrate the fact that we are now at war.
diplomse.lbx     67  000CE     130  en            Emperor \x83 is unable to hold the \x82 military in check, such is their hatred of you. As we speak, ships draw near to go to war.
diplomse.lbx     68  00006      94  en            We just don't like \x81s. Perhaps when you're all enslaved or dead, we will raise our opinion.
diplomse.lbx     68  000CE     125  en            There is such anger and mistrust against the \x81 people that we can no longer silence those calling for blood. To war, then.
diplomse.lbx     68  00196     146  en            We have tried to bolster the failing diplomatic relationship between our Empires, but this can go on no longer. No more talking, now we go to war.
diplomse.lbx     68  0025E     126  en            We will listen to no more of your diplomatic blustering. The grand Emperor \x83 has declared war on the worthless \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx     69  00006      89  en            Emperor \x83 has declared an end to all treaties between the \x82 and hated \x81 Empires.
diplomse.lbx     71  00006     127  en            We have noticed your espionage attempts, \x80, so we are sending some ships to remind you not to trifle with us. War has begun!
diplomse.lbx     72  00006      37  ?             MESSAGE SNEAK ATTACK ESPIONAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     73  00006      54  en            A little payback for your sabotage attacks, \x80. War!
diplomse.lbx     74  00006      36  ?             MESSAGE SNEAK ATTACK SABOTAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx     75  00006     102  en            Your military buildup is creating some itchy \x82 trigger fingers, \x80. We've decided to declare war.
diplomse.lbx     76  00006     117  en            Emperor \x83 was so horrified to learn of your usage of bio-weapons that an attack was authorized. We are now at war.
diplomse.lbx     77  00006      89  en            We do not appreciate the blockade you have in place, \x80. We now declare full scale war!
diplomse.lbx     78  00006     106  en            Time to knock you down a peg or two with a quick offensive, \x80. You are now at war with the \x82 Empire!
diplomse.lbx     79  00006     114  en            You were supposed to vote for Emperor \x83. Some \x82 ships will show up to remind you of that. We are now at war.
diplomse.lbx     80  00006      99  en            Did you think we would stand idly by while you slaughter innocent \x82 people? We will destroy you!
diplomse.lbx     80  000CE     119  en            How dare you enter \x82 space and attack one of our colonies. Beware, \x80 for such treachery will be answered in kind.
diplomse.lbx     80  00196     165  en            Emperor \x83 has withdrawn for the traditional mourning period for those  of \x86 star system. We have been left with orders to destroy any \x81 fleets we encounter.
diplomse.lbx     80  0025E     126  en            Your senseless attack in the \x86 colony has enraged the \x82 people, \x80. The Emperor has authorized full scale retaliation.
diplomse.lbx     80  00326     134  en            Any hope of the \x81 people and the \x82 Empire coexisting peacefully ended when your military attacked the colony in the \x86 system.
diplomse.lbx     80  003EE     100  en            Your cruel assault on our planet in the \x86 system will not go unanswered, \x80. We are now at war!
diplomse.lbx     80  004B6     107  en            Your unjustified attack on our colony was the last straw, Emperor \x80. \x81 blood will run in the streets!
diplomse.lbx     81  00006     149  en            When you ordered the attack on \x82 ships, you crossed the line, \x80. Now it's our turn, and we will not stop until not one \x81 remains in the sky.
diplomse.lbx     81  000CE     122  en            It is a shame you decided to target \x82 ships, \x80, for now we have set our sights on destroying the entire \x81 Empire!
diplomse.lbx     81  00196      84  en            It was foolish of you to turn your weapons on \x82 ships. Now you must be destroyed.
diplomse.lbx     81  0025E     111  en            Your vicious attack on \x82 fleets has prompted a declaration of war, \x80. Your destruction is now inevitable.
diplomse.lbx     81  00326      87  en            We are now at war, \x80 of the \x81s. We will teach you not to provoke the \x82 Empire!
diplomse.lbx     81  003EE     128  en            Emperor \x83 has ordered the military to destroy every \x81 fleet they encounter. Now it is our turn to target your ships, \x80.
diplomse.lbx     81  004B6     126  en            The \x81 attacks on \x82 ships will not go unanswered, Emperor \x80. Prepare to defend yourself against our mighty war engine.
diplomse.lbx     81  0057E      90  en            The \x82 Empire lost some good soldiers when you attacked our fleet, \x80. Prepare to pay!
diplomse.lbx     82  00006     126  en            I don't like you, \x80, I never have. I am proud to bear this message from Emperor \x83: we will blow your ships from the sky!
diplomse.lbx     82  000CE     153  en            We shall make an example of you for others who would resist the might of the \x82 empire.We hereby vow to eradicate all \x81 vermin infesting the galaxy.
diplomse.lbx     82  00196      46  en            The mighty \x82 Empire will destroy you, \x80.
diplomse.lbx     82  0025E      74  en            Our nations stand at war, \x80. We will happily watch your empire crumble.
diplomse.lbx     82  00326     122  en            We have decided to do you the honor of entering into war with you. You are lucky: we only do battle with those we respect.
diplomse.lbx     82  003EE      88  en            Mighty Emperor \x83 is pleased to announce open season on all \x81 animals. To the hunt!
diplomse.lbx     82  004B6      85  en            Our emperor has declared war. When all is said and done, only one empire will remain.
diplomse.lbx     82  0057E     136  en            Although we have strived for peace on a diplomatic level, our citizenry cries for \x81 blood. We have no choice but to seek it for them.
diplomse.lbx     82  00646      53  en            Prepare to feel the might of the great \x82 military!
diplomse.lbx     82  0070E     137  en            There is too much bad blood between our empires, \x80. It is time this was decided once and for all, on the battlefield and in the skies.
diplomse.lbx     82  007D6      45  en            Emperor \x83 has declared war on your people.
diplomse.lbx     82  0089E      89  en            Finally, Emperor \x83 has given us the command we've been waiting for: we attack at will!
diplomse.lbx     83  00006     103  en            Enough of this endless war, Emperor \x80. We propose peace between the \x82 nation and the \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx     83  000CE     102  en            This war has gone on long enough, \x80. Accept this offer of a peace treaty between our great empires.
diplomse.lbx     83  00196     133  en            We could go on fighting, but I believe there is more to be gained from peace. Will you accept an offer of peace from the \x82 Empire?
diplomse.lbx     83  0025E     137  en            There is no need for both our races to continue to suffer in this war. Let us declare peace, and there will be joy throughout the galaxy.
diplomse.lbx     83  00326     129  en            Great \x80, our war has been a tremendous strain on both our peoples. Sign a peace treaty so we can end this senseless bickering.
diplomse.lbx     83  003EE      93  en            The \x82 people are a peace loving nation at heart, \x80. End this war, and join us in peace.
diplomse.lbx     83  004B6     125  en            The \x81 Empire has proven worthy of our friendship, Emperor \x80. Sign a peace treaty, that we may live together in harmony.
diplomse.lbx     83  0057E     129  en            This war could drag on forever, Emperor \x80, and bleed us both dry. Let's end this now, and declare a peace between our nations.
diplomse.lbx     87  00006     130  en            You are foolish to disregard your duties as set forth by our Alliance, \x80. Since you will not honor it, the Alliance is no more!
diplomse.lbx     88  00006      80  en            Thank you for honoring the Grand \x81/\x82 Alliance. Death to our sworn enemies!
diplomse.lbx     89  00006      92  en            Emperor \x83 thanks you for entering into such a fruitful trade treaty with the \x82 Empire.
diplomse.lbx     89  000CE     106  en            We have profited greatly from our trade treaty, mighty Emperor \x80, thank you for honoring the agreement.
diplomse.lbx     90  00006      91  en            Our scientists have learned much from your people, \x80. Thank you for the research treaty.
diplomse.lbx     90  000CE     104  en            The research treaty between our empires is a great benefit to us all. Thanks for honoring the agreement.
diplomse.lbx     91  00006      74  en            We received the annual tribute you promised. Thank you for prompt payment.
diplomse.lbx     91  000CE      81  en            Your payment of the annual tribute to great Emperor \x83 was received. Thank you.
diplomse.lbx     92  00006      87  en            We received the reward you promised us for military intervention, Emperor \x80. Thanks.
diplomse.lbx     93  00006      33  en            MESSAGE REWARD FOR ATTACKING GIFT
diplomse.lbx     94  00006      37  en            MESSAGE REWARD FOR ATTACKING ALLIANCE
diplomse.lbx     95  00006     159  en            Thank you for your vote for  Emperor \x83 in the Council meeting. With enough support, the \x82 Empire will soon assume its rightful place as galactic leaders.
diplomse.lbx     95  000CE      71  en            Your recent vote for Emperor \x83 is greatly appreciated, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx     95  00196      88  en            You made a wise decision to vote for Emperor \x83. We will not soon forget your support.
diplomse.lbx     95  0025E      95  en            Your vote for Emperor \x83 is an optimistic sign for the future of our diplomatic relationship.
diplomse.lbx     95  00326     134  en            Emperor \x83 was pleasantly surprised by your vote at the meeting of the Council, Emperor \x80. Perhaps soon we will return the favor.
diplomse.lbx     95  003EE     120  en            The \x82 people have taken notice of your vote for Emperor \x83. The popularity of the \x81 race has never been so high.
diplomse.lbx     95  004B6     115  en            We applaud your decision to vote for Emperor \x83. We hope all your future diplomatic decisions are so wisely made.
diplomse.lbx     95  0057E     114  en            Emperor \x83 is proud to have your support, Emperor \x80. A few more votes, and the Council will be in good hands.
diplomse.lbx     97  00005     107  en            \x09Let us formalize the friendship between the \x82 and \x81 peoples by agreeing to a Non-Aggression Pact.
diplomse.lbx     97  000CE     130  en            We feel no ill will towards the \x81 Empire. Let us agree to a Non-Aggression Pact so we may both concentrate on our true enemies.
diplomse.lbx     97  00196     123  en            A Non-Aggression treaty between the \x82 Empire and the \x81 Empire will symbolize to all our great respect for each other.
diplomse.lbx     97  0025E     170  en            Why waste resources watching our backs where the \x81 Empire is concerned? Join with us in a Non-Aggression Pact, so all will understand our willingness to work together.
diplomse.lbx     97  00326     111  en            We are a peaceful people, so are the noble \x81. Why not agree on a policy of mutual Non-Aggression between us?
diplomse.lbx     97  003EE     111  en            The \x82 Emperor believes that the greater good would be served by signing a Non-Aggression Pact. What say you?
diplomse.lbx     97  004B6     192  en            Sometimes military hotheads misunderstand the intentions of their rulers. Why risk unwanted fights? They will understand we intend to remain friends by us signing a formal Non-Aggression Pact.
diplomse.lbx     97  0057E      93  en            The mighty \x82 Empire hereby proposes a Non-Aggression Treaty with the glorious \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx     97  00646     134  en            The \x81s may not yet be our brothers, but why remain as enemies. Sign a Non-Aggression Pact, that we may all enjoy freedom from fear.
diplomse.lbx     98  00005     129  en            \x0AWe like you \x81s. So honorable, so proud. Why not sign an Alliance, that we may stand together, protecting both our peoples.
diplomse.lbx     98  000CE      89  en            The \x82 kingdom is proud to propose a bond of eternal friendship and loyalty between us.
diplomse.lbx     98  00196      99  en            It is obvious to all in the \x82 Empire that the time has come for us to forge an undying Alliance.
diplomse.lbx     98  0025E     140  en            An Alliance! Yes, \x80, now is the time to cement the bond between the \x81 people and the \x82s: from now on, we two are one! How about it?
diplomse.lbx     98  00326     160  en            We both know that the \x82 Empire would stand up and fight for \x81 freedom. Why not let everyone else in the Council know, and sign a formal, lasting Alliance.
diplomse.lbx     98  003EE     154  en            We are not enemies. We are more like family, the \x81s and the \x82s. Come, let's sign an Alliance Pact, and stand together against the tyranny of others.
diplomse.lbx     98  004B6     156  en            Like the opening of a door to a wide, vast dominion, fate has opened a grand opportunity for those willing to act. Join with us in an Alliance, friend \x80.
diplomse.lbx     98  0057E     112  en            Like the moon and the sun are partners in the sky, so shall we be, the \x81 and the \x82, united in an Alliance!
diplomse.lbx     98  00646     110  ?             Strength through diversity, Emperor \x80. Together, we can both stand where one alone would fall. An Alliance!
diplomse.lbx     98  0070E     167  en            The bad blood between us flows away like water under a bridge, \x80. We've got to move on, and now is the time: to cross over that bridge and declare ourselves united.
diplomse.lbx     99  00006      80  en            We have much to offer each other, Emperor \x80. Let us agree to Trade agreement.
diplomse.lbx     99  000CE     105  en            We don't agree on everything, \x80, but we can both agree that a Trade pact would be mutually beneficial.
diplomse.lbx     99  00196     116  en            Trade between the \x81s and the \x82s will increase the revenue of both our empires. Sign a Trade agreement with us.
diplomse.lbx     99  0025E      88  en            Emperor \x80, Emperor \x83 hereby proposes a formal Trade agreement between our empires.
diplomse.lbx     99  00326      97  en            Emperor \x83 suggests we form a Trade pact, to better the financial position of both our empires.
diplomse.lbx     99  003EE     121  en            We crave \x81 goods, and you crave \x82 goods. Let us agree to a Trade pact, so that we can mutually satisfy these needs.
diplomse.lbx     99  004B6      81  en            The great \x82 Empire is prepared to sign a Trade agreement with the \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    100  00006      88  en            We are interested in entering into a research treaty with the \x81 Empire. What say you?
diplomse.lbx    101  00006     159  en            Why should we have our researchers waste time studying \x89 when our friends the \x81 already possess this technology? We offer you an advancement in exchange.
diplomse.lbx    101  000CE     100  en            The \x82 Empire has need of \x89. Perhaps you are willing to exchange it for some of our technology.
diplomse.lbx    101  00196     102  en            The secret of \x89 is of great interest to us. We offer you technology in exchange for your knowledge.
diplomse.lbx    101  0025E      90  en            Emperor \x83 would like to give you the gift of some \x82 technology in exchange for \x89.
diplomse.lbx    101  00326     137  en            To assist you, we are willing to reveal to you the fruits of \x82 research. As repayment, you need only give us \x89. Are you interested?
diplomse.lbx    101  003EE     112  en            Emperor \x83 has asked me to bring back the key to \x89. I offer to you an example of \x82 technology in return.
diplomse.lbx    101  004B6      73  en            Let's make a deal: give us \x89 and we will give you some \x82 discovery.
diplomse.lbx    102  00006      68  en            Emperor \x83 requests that you declare war on the hated \x87 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    102  000CE      89  en            If you were to declare war on the \x87 people, you would be rewarded with our friendship.
diplomse.lbx    102  00196     147  en            Surely it has become obvious to you by now that the \x87 threat should be eliminated. We feel it is time the \x81 Empire destroyed them completely.
diplomse.lbx    102  0025E      88  en            As ambassador to the \x82 people, I strongly suggest you declare war on the \x87 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    102  00326      98  en            Why not declare war on the \x87 Empire? I am sure it would only take a year or two to defeat them.
diplomse.lbx    102  003EE      87  en            Emperor \x83 feels that it is time for the \x81 Empire to go to war with the \x87 race.
diplomse.lbx    102  004B6      96  en            We feel that \x8E is the perfect year for a war between the \x81 and \x87 Empires. Do you agree?
diplomse.lbx    102  0057E     132  en            The bond between the \x81 Empire and the great \x82 nation would grow stronger if you increased hostilities against the \x87 people.
diplomse.lbx    104  00006      88  en            Emperor \x80, you must break your treaty with the \x8B dogs if you want to deal with us.
diplomse.lbx    104  000CE     115  en            Any friend of the \x8B Empire is an enemy of mine. If you would deal with me, break your treaty with those animals.
diplomse.lbx    104  00196     110  en            The \x82 people are unwilling to deal with the \x81 Empire as long as you maintain your treaty with the \x8Bs.
diplomse.lbx    104  0025E     145  en            Break your ill-advised treaty with the \x8B Empire, and it will mark the start of a beautiful relationship between the \x81 and the \x82 Empires!
diplomse.lbx    104  00326     103  en            Emperor \x83 will be more willing to work with you if you renounce your agreement with the \x8B Empire.
diplomse.lbx    104  003EE      94  en            Only your treaty with the \x8B stands between us, \x80. Break it, and we can truly be friends.
diplomse.lbx    104  004B6     170  en            We hesitate to deal closely with the \x81 Empire as long as you remained allied with the \x8B people. However, should that bond be broken, we could be best of friends....
diplomse.lbx    104  0057E      87  en            Emperor \x83 suggests that you break off all diplomatic relations with the \x8B Empire.
diplomse.lbx    108  00005      83  en            \x0AThe \x82 military feels the needs some target practice, \x80. Nothing personal.
diplomse.lbx    108  000CE      79  en            The conjunction of planets indicates that we must attack the \x81 Empire today.
diplomse.lbx    108  00196     108  en            It was foretold by the \x82 ancients that a mighty battle with the \x81 people would begin in the year \x8E.
diplomse.lbx    108  0025E     108  en            Emperor \x83 is in a foul mood today. An attack on the \x81 Empire would probably help to lighten that mood.
diplomse.lbx    108  00326      94  en            The great and wise Emperor \x83 of the glorious \x82 Empire decided today to attack you, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    108  003EE      57  en            Can you fit a war into your schedule today, Emperor \x80?
diplomse.lbx    108  004B6      94  en            We have grown tired of dealing with the \x81 Empire. Easier to destroy it than bother with it.
diplomse.lbx    108  0057E      94  en            Emperor \x83 has been unable to come up with a good reason to not attacking you, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    108  00646      81  en            The \x82 military is thirsty for \x81 blood. We will no longer keep them from it.
diplomse.lbx    108  0070E      83  en            The \x82 military has grown lazy. To wake them, we are sending them to destroy you.
diplomse.lbx    109  00006     100  en            I know we have been at peace, \x80, but the \x82 military needs some practice, so now we are at war.
diplomse.lbx    110  000F3      64  en             with the \x81 Empire was made. Therefore, it has been canceled.
diplomse.lbx    110  00196      87  en            There is no treaty between the \x81 animals and the noble \x82 people. There never was!
diplomse.lbx    110  00296      39  en            . We can no longer be bothered with it.
diplomse.lbx    110  00347      39  en             between Emperor \x83 and Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    110  00402      64  en             has been declared unconstitutional, thus nullifying the treaty.
diplomse.lbx    110  004D4     115  en             between the \x82 and \x81 Empires in the news, \x80, but we have no records of such a treaty. Stop spreading lies!
diplomse.lbx    111  00006     118  en            The \x81 Empire is so inferior to the great \x82 Empire that we have decided to destroy you rather than deal with you.
diplomse.lbx    111  000CE     127  en            You are pathetic, Emperor \x80, and your Empire is weak and worthless. Grand Emperor \x83 declares war on the puny \x81 people.
diplomse.lbx    112  00006     124  en            Your Empire is weak, \x80. We have decided to test your defenses with a sneak attack, and if we like the results - then war!
diplomse.lbx    112  000CE     134  en            Your Empire pales in comparision to the great \x82 Empire! Perhaps we will allow our military to remind you of this, with a quick war.
diplomse.lbx    112  00196     163  en            Your military is the laughing stock of the galaxy, \x80. Perhaps you'd like to see what a real fleet can do! The \x82 Empire is now at war with the inferior \x81s.
diplomse.lbx    113  00006     148  en            The \x82 people need more room, and we feel that several of your planets suit us well. We will therefore wrest those planets away from your control.
diplomse.lbx    113  000CE     145  en            The \x82 people demand deliverance from the crowding in their cities. I have no other choice but to declare war, in order to take some territory.
diplomse.lbx    113  00196     134  en            We find peace too confining. A nice war will help us stretch our legs a little, and get the room to grow that the \x82 people require.
diplomse.lbx    113  0025E      91  en            Emperor \x83 regrets to inform you that our need for expansion outgrown our need for peace.
diplomse.lbx    113  00326     127  en            Although we prefer to live at peace, we need to expand. Therefore, we have a new policy: to take what we need, at your expense.
diplomse.lbx    114  00006     178  en            The need to expand our empire is so great, the \x82 military may make unauthorized advances into \x81 space. Don't take it personally, we like you, but declare war just the same.
diplomse.lbx    115  00006      82  en            Emperor \x83 has granted the military permission to attack you. We are now at war.
diplomse.lbx    116  00006     116  en            Upon further reflection, Emperor \x83 has concluded that there is no reason for the \x81 Empire to exist any longer.
diplomse.lbx    116  000CE      98  en            Destroying the \x81 Empire is just another stepping stone in the \x82 path to galactic domination!
diplomse.lbx    116  00196     103  en            It is too quiet, \x80. The \x82 people much prefer the tumult of war. We select you as our next victim.
diplomse.lbx    116  0025E      76  en            The \x81 Empire will fall under the crushing weight of the \x82 war machine!
diplomse.lbx    116  00326      74  en            You may surrender and die, or you may fight us and die. It is your choice.
diplomse.lbx    116  003EE     100  en            The \x82 race is destined to rule the galaxy, \x80. We will no longer allow you to stand in our way.
diplomse.lbx    116  004B6     148  en            Your pathetic empire is a mockery, \x80. We will destroy your fleets and your planets, and regret only the necessary expenditure of \x82 ammunition.
diplomse.lbx    116  0057E      77  en            The war will be quick and the \x82s will be victorious. Nothing else matters.
diplomse.lbx    117  00006     115  en            You think you are big and powerful, \x80, but it is time to remind you that the \x82 Empire also has teeth. To war!
diplomse.lbx    118  00006     143  en            We realize that we are falling behind in this great race for supremacy, so Emperor \x83 has declared war on you, to get you out of the picture.
diplomse.lbx    119  00006      97  en            We are forced to attack the \x81 Empire in an attempt to secure more food for our people. To war!
diplomse.lbx    120  00006     134  en            It is a shame that the peaceful \x82 Empire must go to war to secure the resources it needs, but that is the reality in which we live.
diplomse.lbx    120  000CE     105  en            The \x82 people are hungry and unhappy, Emperor \x80. To satisfy them, we will take what we can from you.
diplomse.lbx    120  00196     136  en            You are hoarding too many valuable resources, \x80. The \x82 people need more food and supplies, and we are coming to take what we need.
diplomse.lbx    120  0025E      89  en            Emperor \x83 has declared war on the \x81 Empire. Now your people will suffer as ours do.
diplomse.lbx    120  00326      97  en            We are forced to declare war on the \x81 Empire in an attempt to secure more food for our people.
diplomse.lbx    120  003EE     160  en            We can no longer sit idle while \x82 children cry for food. Our military has been instructed to use any means necessary to secure more resources for our people.
diplomse.lbx    120  004B6     124  en            Emperor \x83 has declared war on the \x81 Empire. The \x82 people will no longer go hungry while the \x81 Emperor grows fat.
diplomse.lbx    120  0057E     110  en            War has been declared. Our goal: to convert your planets to \x82 farms, and turn your people into \x82 slaves!
diplomse.lbx    121  00006     154  en            Your mere existence makes Emperor \x83 ill. An attack has been ordered to remind you to keep your \x81 monsters away from \x82 territory. We stand at war!
diplomse.lbx    122  00006     153  en            Creatures as hideous as the \x81s should not be allowed to exist in the same galaxy as the beautiful \x82 people. The monsters must be destroyed: to war!
diplomse.lbx    122  000CE     147  en            We can no longer stomach your existence, \x80. Nothing personal, the entire \x81 race makes us ill. We have sworn to eradicate you from the galaxy.
diplomse.lbx    123  00006      82  en            We, the members of the Unified Republic, will destroy you for standing against us!
diplomse.lbx    123  000CE      96  en            The Unified Republic will not tolerate your insubordinance, Emperor \x80. You will be destroyed!
diplomse.lbx    124  00006     139  en            Mighty Emperor \x83 requires your vote at the next meeting of the Council. Place your vote incorrectly, and your Empire will be taken away.
diplomse.lbx    124  000CE      93  en            The \x82 Empire will not crush you if you place your vote for us in the next Council meeting.
diplomse.lbx    125  00006      22  ?             MESSAGE PROPOSE REWARD
diplomse.lbx    126  00006      55  en            The \x82 ambassador was recalled when war was declared.
diplomse.lbx    126  000CE      54  en            There is no time for talk in the heat of battle, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    126  00196      77  en            The Emperor of the \x82 people has nothing to say to the leader of the \x81s.
diplomse.lbx    126  0025E      86  en            Have you not noticed there is a war going on? No one is available to speak to you now.
diplomse.lbx    126  00326      50  en            We are at war, \x80. There is nothing more to say.
diplomse.lbx    126  003EE      47  en            Emperor \x83 does not communicate with enemies!
diplomse.lbx    126  004B6     101  en            Emperor \x83 is too busy directing troops in their attacks on \x81 fleets to talk to the \x81 leader.
diplomse.lbx    126  0057E      93  en            Emperor \x83 will listen when you are ready to surrender. Until then, we have nothing to say.
diplomse.lbx    126  00646     122  en            Your time would be better spent directing your pathetic troops rather than standing around trying to contact Emperor \x83.
diplomse.lbx    126  0070E     110  en            Go away, \x80. Emperor \x83 is too busy listening to the death cries of the \x81 people to spare time for you.
diplomse.lbx    126  007D6      61  en            There will be no diplomatic negotiations while we are at war.
diplomse.lbx    127  00005      86  en            \x0DThe \x82 Emperor regrets that affairs of state preclude negotiations at this time.
diplomse.lbx    127  000CE      56  en            We have more pressing matters to attend to at this time.
diplomse.lbx    127  00196      59  en            The \x82 ambassador is attending to other issues right now.
diplomse.lbx    127  0025E      70  en            No one is available right now to listen to the complaints of the \x81.
diplomse.lbx    127  00326      51  en            Leave us alone, we are tending to internal affairs.
diplomse.lbx    127  003EE      90  en            Emperor \x83 sends regrets to Emperor \x80. \x82 attention is focused elsewhere right now.
diplomse.lbx    127  004B6      57  en            The great Emperor \x83 may not be disturbed at this time.
diplomse.lbx    127  0057E      78  en            Emperor \x83 deems communication with Emperor \x80 inappropriate at this time.
diplomse.lbx    127  00646      70  en            Go away, \x80. Emperor \x83 does not wish to be bothered at this time.
diplomse.lbx    127  0070E      65  en            Mighty Emperor \x83 has no words to waste on little Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    127  007D6      67  en            The \x82 people have no business with the \x81 people at this time.
diplomse.lbx    127  0089E      78  en            Emperor \x83 is meditating right now and cannot be disturbed. Try again later.
diplomse.lbx    127  00966     124  en            You may have nothing better to do than stand around and talk all day, \x80 but Emperor \x83 has more important things to do.
diplomse.lbx    128  00006      45  en            It is a pleasure to meet with you once again.
diplomse.lbx    128  000CE      82  en            The great \x81 and \x82 come together for yet another important moment in history.
diplomse.lbx    128  00196      64  en            The mighty emperor of the \x82 people sends heartfelt greetings.
diplomse.lbx    128  0025E      43  en            It honors me every time we meet, dear \x80.
diplomse.lbx    128  00326      62  en            Emperor \x83 sends hearty regards to you, mighty Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    128  003EE      95  en            As the ambassador of the great \x82 nation, I greet you on behalf of the majestic Emperor \x83.
diplomse.lbx    128  004B6      76  en            Emperor \x83 of the \x82s welcomes this chance to communicate, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    128  0057E      24                Greetings, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    128  00646      51  en            I bring to you the wisdom of glorious Emperor \x83.
diplomse.lbx    128  0070E      79  en            I am pleased to see you are well, Emperor \x80. Emperor \x83 sends best wishes.
diplomse.lbx    128  007D6      95  en            Emperor \x83 is pleased to send the humble \x82 ambassador to meet with the great Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    128  0089E      39  en            Hail mighty Emperor of the \x81 people!
diplomse.lbx    128  00966      85  en            This is a good time to meet, Emperor \x80, for Emperor \x83 is in good spirits today.
diplomse.lbx    128  00A2E      60  en            I come before you in the spirit of friendship, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    128  00AF6      82  en            The \x81 Empire is lucky to have a faithful leader such as yourself, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    128  00BBE      30  ?             Greetings, noble Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    128  00C86      43  en            Salutations from Emperor \x83 of the \x82s.
diplomse.lbx    129  00005      73  en            \x09I have been sent by the glorious Emperor \x83 to deal with you today.
diplomse.lbx    129  000CE      49  en            The mighty \x82 Empire greets the puny \x81 race.
diplomse.lbx    129  00196      60  en            Let's get this meeting over as quickly as possible, Emperor.
diplomse.lbx    129  0025E     108  en            The magnificent Emperor \x83 has but a few minutes to spare for you, \x80, but there is business to discuss.
diplomse.lbx    129  00326      73  en            Despite your less than sterling reputation, Emperor \x83 sends greetings.
diplomse.lbx    129  003EE      68  en            An audience with the mighty \x81 Empire has been reluctantly called.
diplomse.lbx    129  004B6      89  en            The \x81s are not popular with the \x82 people right now, \x80. Let's get this over with.
diplomse.lbx    129  0057E     106  en            Although I do not take any pleasure in continued contact with you, there is business to settle between us.
diplomse.lbx    129  00646      21  ?             Listen up, \x81 scum.
diplomse.lbx    130  00006      80  en            We tire of diplomatic negotiations. We can continue discussions at a later time.
diplomse.lbx    130  000CE      64  en            I must be going, Emperor \x80, other duties demand my attention.
diplomse.lbx    130  00196     121  ?             So many words, \x80 but so little wisdom. Perhaps we can meet again later, when you've gained more diplomatic experience.
diplomse.lbx    130  0025E      79  en            Emperor \x83 has called for me to speak before the \x82 assembly, so I must go.
diplomse.lbx    130  00326      64  en            Although I have enjoyed our conversation, I am needed elsewhere.
diplomse.lbx    130  003EE      97  en            Emperor \x83 has received an urgent message and must discontinue this meeting for the time being.
diplomse.lbx    130  004B6      93  en            I will take your words back to the \x82 Emperor for contemplation and study. Goodbye for now.
diplomse.lbx    130  0057E      27  ?             Another time, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    130  00646     103  en            My mind is elsewhere, dear \x80 I will return to continue our conversation after I have chance to rest.
diplomse.lbx    130  0070E      97  en            It has been an honor to speak with you again, Emperor \x80 of the \x81s. I'll see you again soon.
diplomse.lbx    130  007D6      49  en            This talk is getting us nowhere. Goodnight, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    130  0089E      53  en            Emperor \x83 has nothing more to say on this subject.
diplomse.lbx    130  00966      76  en            I have other empires to deal with, \x80. I will return when I have a chance.
diplomse.lbx    130  00A2E     103  en            There are more demands on \x85 \x82 ambassador than there is time in a day, \x80. I must leave you now.
diplomse.lbx    130  00AF6      26  en            This discussion is closed.
diplomse.lbx    130  00BBE      96  en            I am urgently needed elsewhere, Emperor \x80. Perhaps we can take this up again at a later date.
diplomse.lbx    131  00006      86  en            The \x82s agree to a Non-Aggression Pact. Neither side will attack the other's fleets.
diplomse.lbx    131  000CE     107  en            If you agree not to send ships to any of our colonies, the \x82 people vow to not attack any of your ships.
diplomse.lbx    131  00196      59  en            The \x82 people accept your offer of mutual Non-Aggression.
diplomse.lbx    131  0025E      83  en            We will sign your Non-Aggression Pact. You leave us alone, we will leave you alone.
diplomse.lbx    131  00326     102  en            The \x82 Empire welcomes the opportunity to enter into a Non-Aggression alliance with the \x81 people.
diplomse.lbx    131  003EE      87  en            We accept your proposal. Both our empires will benefit from a freedom from hostilities.
diplomse.lbx    131  004B6     134  en            Emperor \x83 has agreed to your proposed Non-Aggression pact. The \x82 troops have been ordered to allow \x81 travel in our territory.
diplomse.lbx    131  0057E     136  en            We do not feel that the \x81 Empire is a threat to us. Emperor \x83 agrees to the proposal, so that we may turn our attention elsewhere.
diplomse.lbx    132  00005     106  en            \x09So our Alliance is forged. Your ships may visit our colonies as you wish, and get fuel from our bases.
diplomse.lbx    132  000CE      97  en            An Alliance between two honorable races. Long live the \x81s and the \x82s, death to our enemies!
diplomse.lbx    132  00196      67  en            United, none can stand against us. We accept the proposed Alliance.
diplomse.lbx    132  0025E      66  en            An Alliance does seem the logical conclusion, \x80. We are agreed.
diplomse.lbx    132  00326      67  en            Emperor \x83 agrees to an Alliance between the \x82s and the \x81s.
diplomse.lbx    132  003EE     110  en            Emperor \x83 agrees that the ships of our brothers the \x81s are welcome in our space. Long live the Alliance!
diplomse.lbx    132  004B6      70  en            The idea of an Alliance is pleasing to Emperor \x83. The pact is made!
diplomse.lbx    132  0057E     124  en            The strength of the \x81 Empire and the wisdom of the great Emperor \x83 is an unbeatable combination. We agree to Alliance.
diplomse.lbx    132  00646      66  en            Emperor \x83 can see the profound wisdom in an Alliance. So be it!
diplomse.lbx    133  00006      65  en            We find your offer of trade to be fair and just, \x80. We accept.
diplomse.lbx    133  000CE      74  en            Emperor \x83 is willing to enter into a Trade treaty with the \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    133  00196      86  en            We will supply the \x81 Empire with goods equal in value to the goods you offer to us.
diplomse.lbx    133  0025E      68  en            The Trade treaty you propose is acceptable to the wise Emperor \x83.
diplomse.lbx    133  00326      67  en            The Trade treaty is accepted. May both our peoples prosper from it!
diplomse.lbx    133  003EE      65  en            \x81 goods will be welcomed in \x82 worlds. The treaty is signed.
diplomse.lbx    133  004B6     102  en            We have waited a long time to gain access to valuable \x81 goods. We sign the Trade agreement readily.
diplomse.lbx    133  0057E      92  en            Although we already have all we need, we agree to a Trade alliance in the spirit of charity.
diplomse.lbx    134  00006      75  en            There is wisdom in your words, Emperor \x80. We accept the Research treaty.
diplomse.lbx    134  000CE      83  en            Both our empires will benefit from the Research treaty you propose. Offer accepted.
diplomse.lbx    134  00196      89  en            We ourselves were going to suggest such a treaty. You beat us to it, \x80, but we accept.
diplomse.lbx    134  0025E     105  en            The combined efforts of \x81 and \x82 scientists will lead to untold wonders. We gladly grant the treaty.
diplomse.lbx    134  00326      92  en            I am honored to accept the Research treaty on behalf of the honorable and just Emperor \x83.
diplomse.lbx    135  00005     124  en            \x0AWar is a terrible thing. A battle on the outside leads to a war within: to seek peace or justice? This time, peace wins.
diplomse.lbx    135  000CE     134  en            With feelings of pride for those who fought valiantly and despair for those that fell in battle, we hereby accept your offer of peace.
diplomse.lbx    135  00196      81  en            Emperor \x83 grows weary of senseless destruction. We accept your offer of peace.
diplomse.lbx    135  0025E      78  en            Emperor \x83 also desires an end to the needless destruction and loss of life.
diplomse.lbx    135  00326      88  en            Emperor \x83 hereby orders all hostilities to end between the \x82 and the \x81 empires.
diplomse.lbx    135  003EE      87  en            The year \x8E will be remembered as the end to the war between the \x82s and the \x81s.
diplomse.lbx    135  004B6      94  en            Peace at last will come to the great \x81 and \x82 Empires. All is well in the galaxy tonight.
diplomse.lbx    135  0057E     106  en            This talk of peace is pleasing to Emperor \x83. Our military will be given these instructions immediately.
diplomse.lbx    135  00646      91  en            A cease fire will be called by Emperor \x83 as soon as you command the same to your troops.
diplomse.lbx    135  0070E     116  en            This war has been taxing on both of our Empires. I accept your proposal of peace in the name of mighty Emperor \x83.
diplomse.lbx    136  00006      71  en            Emperor \x83 agrees to your wished in the spirit of our grand Alliance.
diplomse.lbx    136  000CE      87  en            The \x82 people are willing to agree to this wish of the \x81s, our friends and allies.
diplomse.lbx    136  00196      78  en            Thank you, Emperor \x80. I gladly accept on behalf of your ally, Emperor \x83.
diplomse.lbx    136  0025E      71  en            The Alliance between the \x82s and the \x81s remains strong. We accept.
diplomse.lbx    136  00326      55  en            We accept your offer. Long live the \x81 \x82 Alliance!
diplomse.lbx    136  003EE      77  en            We are willing to accept your proposal in the name of the \x82-\x81 Alliance.
diplomse.lbx    136  004B6      62  en            Emperor \x83 accepts the offer of our wise ally, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    136  0057E     121  en            Our Alliance must remain intact. We accept your proposal to show our faith in the bond between the \x82 and \x81 Empires.
diplomse.lbx    137  00005      91  en            \x09Emperor \x83 gladly accepts the wishes of mighty \x80, who graciously gave us the \x8C.
diplomse.lbx    137  000CE     115  en            The \x8C you gave us proved very valuable. Emperor \x83 does not forget such generosity, and accepts your proposal.
diplomse.lbx    137  00196      80  en            How could we refuse, Emperor \x80, after your generous gift of the \x8C earlier?
diplomse.lbx    137  0025E      90  en            The \x82 Empire profited from the \x8C you shared with us, so Emperor \x83 gladly accepts.
diplomse.lbx    137  00326      94  en            The \x8C you gave us helped to speed our development, \x80, so we gladly accept your proposal.
diplomse.lbx    137  003EE      91  en            With the memory of the \x8C you gave us fresh in our minds, Emperor \x83 can hardly refuse.
diplomse.lbx    137  004B6      71  en            Just as you gifted us with the \x8C, we give you the gift of agreement.
diplomse.lbx    137  0057E      80  en            To our friends that selflessly gave us the \x8C, we fondly accept your proposal.
diplomse.lbx    137  00646     136  en            The \x8C that you gave us has benefited us greatly. We accept your proposal, and hope that it in small part repays you for your trouble.
diplomse.lbx    138  00006      49  en            Your offer is not pleasing to great Emperor \x83.
diplomse.lbx    138  000CE      88  en            Emperor \x83 feels that the \x82 Empire would lose more than it gained in this proposal.
diplomse.lbx    138  00196      48  en            The \x82 Emperor is not interested at this time.
diplomse.lbx    138  0025E      68  en            Although Emperor \x83 is appreciative of the offer, we must decline.
diplomse.lbx    138  00326      88  en            Emperor \x83 has thought about your offer, \x80, but finds it unacceptable at this time.
diplomse.lbx    138  003EE      55  en            The \x82 nation declines the offer of the \x81 Emperor.
diplomse.lbx    138  004B6     103  en            Your proposal is rejected. Try again when you have something more interesting to offer the \x82 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    138  0057E      48  en            The \x82 Empire has no use for your offer, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    138  00646     114  en            Your proposal is declined, \x80. Emperor \x83 suggests you think of a proposal more beneficial to the \x82 people.
diplomse.lbx    138  0070E      99  en            The great and wise Emperor \x83 of the \x82 nation declines the offer of Emperor \x80 of the \x81s.
diplomse.lbx    138  007D6      45  en            We do not see the wisdom in your offer, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    138  0089E      53  en            Your proposal is declined at this time, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    138  00966      56  en            Your offer is generous but we must decline at this time.
diplomse.lbx    138  00A2E      49  en            Emperor \x83 will not accept such an offer, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    138  00AF6      62  en            The \x81 offer is found to be unacceptable to the \x82 people.
diplomse.lbx    138  00BBE      29  en            We simply are not interested.
diplomse.lbx    138  00C86      81  en            Your proposal has been review and rejected, \x80. But we thank you for the offer.
diplomse.lbx    138  00D4E     125  en            Although there are those in the \x82 Empire that see some gain in your proposal, wise Emperor \x83 does not choose to accept.
diplomse.lbx    138  00E16      42  en            Your offer is found lacking, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    138  00EDE      42  en            Such an offer is not welcome at this time.
diplomse.lbx    138  00FA6      58  en            The great Emperor \x83 is not interested in your proposal.
diplomse.lbx    138  0106E     102  en            The time may come when Emperor \x83 would agree to such an offer, but right now we are not interested.
diplomse.lbx    138  01136      49  en            Such an arrangement is unthinkable, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    138  011FE      22                Emperor \x83 declines.
diplomse.lbx    139  00006      76  en            We see no reason to deal with someone who has not lived up to past promises.
diplomse.lbx    139  000CE      95  en            You've broken treaties in the past, \x80. Why should we believe more of your white washed lies?
diplomse.lbx    139  00196     113  en            The promises of Emperor \x80 are worthless, in light of the treaties the \x81 Empire has not honored in the past.
diplomse.lbx    139  0025E      93  en            You have shown that you have no honor, \x80. We do not make agreements with a treaty breaker.
diplomse.lbx    139  00326      67  en            The \x82 Empire will not fall prey to the lies of the \x81 Emperor.
diplomse.lbx    139  003EE      66  en            We choose to reject the offer made by treaty breaker Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    139  004B6      98  en            You don't have a very good track record of keeping your word, \x80, so we must decline this offer.
diplomse.lbx    139  0057E     149  en            There is no way we could force such a proposition on the honorable \x82 people. They have no respect for a \x81 leader that does not uphold treaties.
diplomse.lbx    140  00006      76  en            You have dishonored the illustrious Emperor \x83. Your proposal is rejected.
diplomse.lbx    140  000CE      94  en            The \x82 Empire still smarts from the blow you dealt her. Your ideas have fallen on deaf ears.
diplomse.lbx    140  00196      91  en            We are not interested in making any arrangements with the dishonorable leader of the \x81s.
diplomse.lbx    140  0025E      83  en            You have not honored us, \x80 and so we will not honor you. Your offer is rejected.
diplomse.lbx    140  00326     102  en            We will never listen to the ideas of one such as yourself, \x80. The \x82 Empire demands more respect.
diplomse.lbx    140  003EE     103  en            After the dishonor you caused Emperor \x83, there is now way we would enter into an agreement with you.
diplomse.lbx    140  004B6     130  en            I cannot even bring this suggestion to the Emperor's attention. You are not held in high regard after the trouble you caused \x83.
diplomse.lbx    140  0057E     104  en            Such an arrangement is impossible, \x80. The \x81s are neither trusted nor respected in the \x82 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    141  00006      63  en            You are untrustworthy, Emperor \x80. We will not deal with you.
diplomse.lbx    141  000CE     119  en            We do not believe that you are capable of keeping your word, Emperor \x80. We will not deal with those we do not trust.
diplomse.lbx    142  00005      58  en            \x09Get your spies out of \x82 territory, then we'll talk.
diplomse.lbx    142  000CE     104  en            There can be no agreement between us as long as malicious \x81 spies continue to roam in \x82 territory.
diplomse.lbx    142  00196     107  en            You send underhanded spies to steal the fruits of \x82 research, and expect us to listen to your proposals?
diplomse.lbx    142  0025E      57  en            You are a thief, not an Emperor. We reject your proposal.
diplomse.lbx    142  00326      49  en            So the thief comes begging? Emperor \x83 refuses!
diplomse.lbx    142  003EE     108  en            Your spies are not welcome in our territory, and your proposals are not welcome in this diplomatic assembly.
diplomse.lbx    142  004B6     107  en            We will not give free cooperation to the \x81 people as long as \x81 spies continue to steal our resources.
diplomse.lbx    142  0057E      40  en            Emperor \x83 does not deal with thieves.
diplomse.lbx    142  00646      66  en            Do you think that we are unaware of your espionage? Offer refused!
diplomse.lbx    143  00006      32  ?             RESPONSE REJECT ESPIONAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx    144  00006      94  en            We have suffered much from your malicious sabotage attacks. There will be no deals made today.
diplomse.lbx    144  000CE     105  en            We know you are responsible for the recent attacks on \x82 facilities. We will not listen to your offers.
diplomse.lbx    144  00196     108  en            Emperor \x83 is too disgusted by your recent destruction of \x82 factories and bases to listen to proposals.
diplomse.lbx    144  0025E      72  en            The \x81 saboteurs have destroyed any chance of an agreement between us.
diplomse.lbx    144  00326      88  en            Emperor \x80, do you take us as fools? No! We reject the offer of the destructive \x81s.
diplomse.lbx    144  003EE     122  en            We have not forgotten your last sabotage incident. Until you have proven to be more trustworthy we will not deal with you.
diplomse.lbx    144  004B6      94  en            We are still rebuilding the damage your saboteurs caused. Our trust is not so easily repaired.
diplomse.lbx    144  0057E      94  en            There will be no deals made between the honorable Emperor \x83 and the malicious Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    145  00006      31  ?             RESPONSE REJECT SABOTAGE FRAMED
diplomse.lbx    147  00005      98  en            \x09The cries of those killed by your biological weapons fill our ears. We cannot hear your offer.
diplomse.lbx    147  000CE     105  en            Emperor \x83 will not make any deals with someone whose hands are covered with the blood of the innocent.
diplomse.lbx    147  00196      90  en            We do not approve of the use of biological weaponry. We choose not to deal with murderers.
diplomse.lbx    147  0025E      99  en            The evil \x81 biological weapons destroyed any chance of agreement between the \x82s and the \x81s.
diplomse.lbx    147  00326      86  en            Emperor \x83 rejects all offers form those who sanction the use of biological weapons.
diplomse.lbx    147  003EE      98  en            The blood of the innocents murdered by your biological weapons still hangs on you, \x80 We reject.
diplomse.lbx    147  004B6      91  en            We reject your proposal, \x80. We will not deal with a coward that resorts to bio-weaponry.
diplomse.lbx    147  0057E     136  en            The \x82 people were shocked and sickened by your use of biological weapons on an innocent population. There can be no deals between us.
diplomse.lbx    147  00646     121  en            There is still innocent blood on your hands, \x80, and you expect us to shake those hands in diplomatic agreement? Never!
diplomse.lbx    148  00006      81  en            Remove your blockade. Emperor \x83 will not listen to any \x81 offers until then.
diplomse.lbx    148  000CE      84  en            We suffer because of your blockade, \x80, but not enough to give in to your demands.
diplomse.lbx    148  00196      70  en            Emperor \x83 declines to speak with you until the blockade is removed.
diplomse.lbx    148  0025E      74  en            The blockade must fall before we can even begin to consider such an offer.
diplomse.lbx    148  00326     113  en            First you will cancel your blockade of \x82 space. Next, you will apologize. Then, we may consider your proposal.
diplomse.lbx    148  003EE      67  en            You are crazy. We will not deal with someone blockading our system!
diplomse.lbx    148  004B6      88  en            Such an offer is unacceptable. Do you imagine we forget the \x81 blockade in \x82 space?
diplomse.lbx    148  0057E      78  en            Your blockade will not scare us into making such rash decisions, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    149  00006      66  en            Emperor \x83 cannot make such agreements with power hungry madmen.
diplomse.lbx    149  000CE      77  en            We must decline your offer at this time, \x80. Tensions are running too high.
diplomse.lbx    149  00196      92  en            There has been too much \x81 economic expansion for us to agree to proposals. Offer refused.
diplomse.lbx    149  0025E     101  en            Your proposal has been rejected. Perhaps your wealth does not give you as much power as you imagined.
diplomse.lbx    149  00326     134  en            The \x82 people will not be bullied into any agreements with you. Just because your economy is strong, does not mean your military is.
diplomse.lbx    149  003EE     128  en            We cannot agree to your proposal, \x80. There is too much at stake here to place any bets on greedy egomaniacs such as yourself.
diplomse.lbx    150  00005      86  en            \x09Emperor \x83 does not forget your last misplaced Council vote, \x80. Offer denied.
diplomse.lbx    150  000CE      93  en            Maybe if you had voted for Emperor \x83 last time, we would be more open to your suggestions.
diplomse.lbx    150  00196      40  es            Sorry, \x80. No \x82 vote, no \x81 deal.
diplomse.lbx    150  0025E     101  en            We are still too saddened by your last Council vote to entertain the thought of accepting your offer.
diplomse.lbx    150  00326     119  en            You are currently out of favor with the \x82 court for your unfortunate choice to vote against us last Council meeting.
diplomse.lbx    150  003EE     102  en            When the glorious and righteous Emperor \x83 receives your Council vote, we will listen to your ideas.
diplomse.lbx    150  004B6      88  en            We deal only with friends, \x80. You voted against Emperor \x83, that is not friendship.
diplomse.lbx    150  0057E     138  en            We find the terms of your offer unacceptable. Perhaps if you had voted for Emperor \x83, we would have been more open to your suggestions.
diplomse.lbx    150  00646     111  en            Until it is clear that you have accepted Emperor \x83's destiny to lead the Council, we will not deal with you.
diplomse.lbx    151  00006      76  en            There will be no bargains made after your malicious attack on \x82 colonies.
diplomse.lbx    151  000CE     100  en            You must offer restitution for your butchery on our \x86 colony before we will listen to this offer.
diplomse.lbx    151  00196     112  en            The mighty Emperor \x83 lost many valued citizens in your raid of our \x86 system colony. Your offer is refused.
diplomse.lbx    151  0025E     102  en            Perhaps if you had asked before the attack on \x86 system colonies, we may have considered your offer.
diplomse.lbx    151  00326     100  en            Your unjustified assault on our colonies leaves you little room for bargaining with the \x82 people.
diplomse.lbx    151  003EE     115  en            \x81 soldiers were responsible for the destruction of our precious \x82 colony, and you expect us to listen to you?
diplomse.lbx    151  004B6     119  en            If you could restore the \x86 colony you attacked to its former beauty, we might deign to consider this silly proposal.
diplomse.lbx    151  0057E     125  en            Your offer is completely out of the question. Emperor \x83 is still too angry about what your attack in the \x86 star system.
diplomse.lbx    152  00006     111  en            Your military has been responsible for the destruction of too many \x82 ships for us to consider your proposal.
diplomse.lbx    152  000CE     130  en            \x83, the mighty Emperor of the \x82 nation, rejects your offer. Too many \x82ships have been blown from the sky by \x81 fanatics.
diplomse.lbx    152  00196      67  en            Leave our fleets alone, \x80. We will not listen to you until then.
diplomse.lbx    152  0025E      72  en            Tell your pilots to stop targeting \x82 ships and then we'll discuss it.
diplomse.lbx    152  00326      76  en            Never. We will never agree to that as long as you keep attacking our fleets.
diplomse.lbx    152  003EE     105  en            Your proposal sounds insincere, coming from the lips of the commander of the troops attacking our fleets.
diplomse.lbx    152  004B6      86  en            Tell your ships to leave \x82 fleets alone. We will not deal with the \x82 until then.
diplomse.lbx    152  0057E      78  en            Emperor \x83 rejects the offer and commands you to stop shooting at our ships!
diplomse.lbx    153  00006     115  en            It saddens Emperor \x82 that you value our friendship so little. We gained much from our treaty, now it is no more.
diplomse.lbx    153  000CE      54  en            We didn't care about that treaty anyway, \x81 Emperor.
diplomse.lbx    154  00006     120  en            You show great lack of respect for the great Emperor \x83. We had thought the \x81 people were more honorable than that.
diplomse.lbx    155  00006      92  en            You dare cancel a treaty with the mighty \x82 Empire? Very foolish, \x80. We are now at war!
diplomse.lbx    155  000CE      97  en            That treaty was all that was protecting you, Emperor \x80. Now that it's gone, the war has begun.
diplomse.lbx    155  00196     109  en            That treaty was all that was standing between us and war, \x80. Now that you've canceled it, the fight is on.
diplomse.lbx    156  00006     111  en            If you had not ended the trade treaty, we would have. There is no profit to be gained in dealing in \x81 goods.
diplomse.lbx    156  000CE      67  en            We will not soon forget your abandonment of the trade treaty, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    157  00006     106  en            We cannot maintain our other treaties if you no longer honor the trade treaty.  All treaties are repealed.
diplomse.lbx    157  000CE     123  en            It is not worthwhile to maintain our other treaties if you no longer agree to the trade treaty.  All treaties are canceled.
diplomse.lbx    157  00196     154  en            What assurances do we have that you won't cancel all our agreements come tomorrow? The situation is unacceptable, Emperor \x80. All treaties are canceled.
diplomse.lbx    158  00006      82  en            The research treaty we held benefited you more than us, \x80. We will not miss it.
diplomse.lbx    158  000CE     135  en            Our scientists shared much information. We are saddened that you are no longer interested in furthering the advancement of your people.
diplomse.lbx    159  00006     176  en            We only agreed to other treaties with the \x81 Empire to gain the benefits of the research treaty. Since you canceled that, we hereby cancel all agreements between our Empires.
diplomse.lbx    159  000CE      91  en            No research treaty, no deal. All agreements between the \x81 and \x82 Empires are canceled.
diplomse.lbx    160  00006      36  en            We welcome war with the \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    160  000CE      67  en            You will learn to regret that decision, \x80. If you live, that is.
diplomse.lbx    160  00196     128  en            Let history show that you were the one that started this war, \x80. You will be the villain, the \x82 Empire will be the victor.
diplomse.lbx    161  00006      52  en            Thank you for the technology you have given us,\x80.
diplomse.lbx    161  000CE      79  en            Emperor \x83 sends heartfelt thanks for the technology you have shared with us.
diplomse.lbx    162  00006      86  en            Your tribute has been accepted as reparations for your crimes against the \x82 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    162  000CE     102  en            Your offer is a generous one. I hope this is the start of a new relationship between us, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    162  00196     147  en            Emperor \x83 has been distrustful of your motives, but your tribute now offers a way to significantly reduce the tension between our great empires.
diplomse.lbx    162  0025E      82  en            Your tribute is generous, Emperor \x80, and you are a wise leader for offering it.
diplomse.lbx    162  00326      64  en            The tribute you suggest is accepted in the spirit of friendship.
diplomse.lbx    162  003EE      93  en            Emperor \x80, the \x82 Empire applauds your generous tribute and welcomes future cooperation.
diplomse.lbx    162  004B6      69  en            Emperor \x83 accepts the tribute in the spirit in which it was given.
diplomse.lbx    162  0057E     124  en            We thank you for your tribute to the great Emperor \x83, and look forward to receiving many fine gifts from the \x81 people.
diplomse.lbx    163  00006      95  en            Although you cannot buy our friendship, your  money will go a long way in restoring \x82 favor.
diplomse.lbx    163  000CE      75  en            Emperor \x83 thanks you for the contribution to the \x82 monetary reserves.
diplomse.lbx    163  00196      90  en            If you have money to spare, we would be foolish to not accept it. Emperor \x83 thanks you.
diplomse.lbx    163  0025E      32  ?             Long live generous Emperor \x80!
diplomse.lbx    163  00326      70  en            The \x82 Empire is honored to accept money from the great \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    163  003EE      63  en            We will take your money, \x80, but offer no promises in return.
diplomse.lbx    163  004B6     157  en            The diplomatic relations between the \x82 Empire and the \x81 nation have been strained. Your generous offer will help restore \x82 faith in your leadership.
diplomse.lbx    164  00006      71  en            Emperor \x83 thanks you for the star system that you handed over to us.
diplomse.lbx    164  000CE     117  en            The star system you gave us has proved a worthy addition to our Empire, \x80. We thank you for handing it over to us.
diplomse.lbx    165  00006     128  en            Your demand is unreasonable and ridiculous. Surely you have lost your mind. Emperor \x83 has declared war on crazy Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    165  000CE     102  en            Not only do we reject your proposal, but we declare war on the \x81 Empire for suggesting such a deal.
diplomse.lbx    166  00006      87  en            The \x82 people refuse to maintain a treaty with one who would make ridiculous demands!
diplomse.lbx    166  000CE     123  en            It is clear that you mean to take advantage of us, \x80. We decline your proposal, as well as cancel all existing treaties.
diplomse.lbx    167  00006     103  en            We will not bow to your demands, \x80. We do not so easily forget how you've dealt with us in the past.
diplomse.lbx    167  000CE     101  en            Emperor \x83 rejects your proposal. Time has not erased the memory of how you treated us in the past.
diplomse.lbx    168  00006      38  en            Emperor \x83 refuses to be threatened.
diplomse.lbx    168  000CE      69  en            The \x82 Empire will not give in to your petty demands, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    168  00196      43  en            Emperor \x83 laughs at your hollow threats!
diplomse.lbx    168  0025E     102  en            We do not respond well to demands, \x80. Tread carefully, or you may live to regret your lack of tact.
diplomse.lbx    168  00326      92  en            You presume to make demands of the mighty Emperor \x83! You forget who you are dealing with!
diplomse.lbx    168  003EE      51  en            We see no need to bow to your wishes, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    169  00006      66  en            Emperor \x83 has agreed to your suggestion, we will do as you say.
diplomse.lbx    169  000CE      46  en            We are willing to do as you ask, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    169  00196      36  en            Your suggestion is found acceptable.
diplomse.lbx    171  00006      70  en            We have lost respect for you. We will no longer pay you tribute, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    171  000CE      46  en            Emperor \x83 has cancelled the tribute treaty.
diplomse.lbx    171  00196      46  en            Emperor \x83 has cancelled the tribute treaty.
diplomse.lbx    172  00006      85  en            You do not honor us with your actions, so we will no longer honor you with a tribute.
diplomse.lbx    173  00006      83  en            All payments to the \x81 Empire ceased the moment Emperor \x83 declared war on you!
diplomse.lbx    173  000CE     101  en            The \x82 Empire has declared war on you, \x80. Needless to say, the tribute treaty has been repealed.
diplomse.lbx    173  00196     100  en            Emperor \x83 has declared war on your Empire. Needless to say, the tribute treaty has been canceled.
diplomse.lbx    174  00006      48  en            \x80, you don't have any tech that interests me.
diplomse.lbx    174  000CE      81  en            Our science is superior to yours, \x80. You have no technology of interest to us.
diplomse.lbx    175  00006      80  en            You find no need to agree to our proposals, so we see no need to agree to yours.
diplomse.lbx    176  00006     119  en            You have betrayed us in the past, so we will strike first now, before you betray us again! We are at war, Emperor \x80.
diplomse.lbx    176  000CE     135  en            You have already shown yourself to have no honor, \x80. An attack has been ordered, to repay you for past betrayals. We are now at war!
diplomse.lbx    177  00031      48  en            , and we will not allow you backstab us. To war!
diplomse.lbx    177  000E4      87  en             Empire proves that you are untrustworthy. We declare war on the dishonest \x81 Empire.
diplomse.lbx    178  00006     154  en            We know that we are the only force in galaxy that can stop your mindless expansion. We are up to the task, and we take the offensive! We are at war, \x80.
diplomse.lbx    178  000CE     132  en            As the last stronghold standing against \x81 tyranny, it is up to us to keep you in line. An attack has been ordered, we are at war.
diplomse.lbx    179  00006      42  en            So be it, great Emperor \x83 declares war!
diplomse.lbx    179  000CE      48  en            We accept your decision, but declare war anyway.
diplomse.lbx    179  00196      21  en            Alright then, to war!
engmsg.lbx        0  00043      62  en            Titan Construction Tech is required to build TITAN class ships
engmsg.lbx        0  0046A      70  en            Doom Star Construction Tech is required to build DOOM STAR class ships
engmsg.lbx        0  00891      87  en            You need to build a Star Base or a Star Fortress before you can build LARGE class ships
engmsg.lbx        0  00CB8      86  en            You need to build a Star Base or a Star Fortress before you can build HUGE class ships
engmsg.lbx        0  010DF      87  en            You need to build a Star Base or a Star Fortress before you can build TITAN class ships
engmsg.lbx        0  01506      91  en            You need to build a Star Base or a Star Fortress before you can build DOOM STAR class ships
engmsg.lbx        0  0192D      61  en            Your current design is too big to fit into a SMALL class ship
engmsg.lbx        0  01D54      62  en            Your current design is too big to fit into a MEDIUM class ship
engmsg.lbx        0  0217B      61  en            Your current design is too big to fit into a LARGE class ship
engmsg.lbx        0  025A2      60  en            Your current design is too big to fit into a HUGE class ship
engmsg.lbx        0  029C9      61  en            Your current design is too big to fit into a TITAN class ship
engmsg.lbx        0  02DF0      65  en            Your current design is too big to fit into a DOOM STAR class ship
engmsg.lbx        0  03217      52  en            You may not change hull sizes while refitting a ship
engmsg.lbx        0  0363E      66  en            Since %s cannot build %s size ships, you may not change hull sizes
engmsg.lbx        0  03A26      15  ?             Blue-White Star
engmsg.lbx        0  03A65     216  en            The blue-white stars are the hottest of all the stars, emitting extreme amounts of solar radiation. The blue-white star is likely to have planets that will be mineral rich, but totally unsuitable for supporting life.
engmsg.lbx        0  03E4D      10                White Star
engmsg.lbx        0  03E8C     140  en            White stars have a fair chance of having planets. If present, these planets  will be high in mineral resources, but can barely support life.
engmsg.lbx        0  04274      11                Yellow Star
engmsg.lbx        0  042B3     180  en            Yellow stars are the same spectral class as our sun. The yellow star will quite frequently have planets with moderate mineral resources and a good  environment for supporting life.
engmsg.lbx        0  0469B      11                Orange Star
engmsg.lbx        0  046DA     124  en            Orange stars will frequently have planets with the best chance of being habitable, but tend to be poor in mineral resources.
engmsg.lbx        0  04AC2       8                Red Star
engmsg.lbx        0  04B01     178  en            Red stars are the dimmest, coolest stars. The have a poor chance of having planets. If planets do exist, they will have minimal environments and extremely poor mineral resources.
engmsg.lbx        0  04EE9       8                Cheating
engmsg.lbx        0  04F28     168  en            The High Council Intelligence Agency (HCIA) has found evidence that %s, the highest %s, on  has CHEATED!!! Deal with this in a manner that befits your culture's custom.
