ESTRINGS.LBX      0  0007D      60  en    Eric     %s will goto the officer pool and thanks you for the %d BC
ESTRINGS.LBX      0  000BA      53  en    Eric     %s will wait a while to see if you can raise the %d.
ESTRINGS.LBX      0  000F0      49  en    Eric     %s will wait to see if you will pay %d BC later.
