HESTRNGS.LBX      0  0039C      66  en    Harold  Since %s cannot build %s size ships, you may not change hull sizes
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  003DF     216  en    Harold  The blue-white stars are the hottest of all the stars, emitting extreme amounts of solar radiation. The blue-white star is likely to have planets that will be mineral rich, but totally unsuitable for supporting life.
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  004B8     140  en    Harold  White stars have a fair chance of having planets. If present, these planets  will be high in mineral resources, but can barely support life.
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  00545     180  en    Harold  Yellow stars are the same spectral class as our sun. The yellow star will quite frequently have planets with moderate mineral resources and a good  environment for supporting life.
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  005FA     124  en    Harold  Orange stars will frequently have planets with the best chance of being habitable, but tend to be poor in mineral resources.
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  00677     178  en    Harold  Red stars are the dimmest, coolest stars. The have a poor chance of having planets. If planets do exist, they will have minimal environments and extremely poor mineral resources.
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  0072A     271  en    Harold  Brown stars are really cool! They're so cool that astronomers throughout the galaxy have been unable to put their majestic beauty into words. Perhaps after another millenium of study, our vocabulary will have been increased  sufficiently to describe these bundles of joy!
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  0083A     184  en    Harold  Black holes are ancient stars that have collapsed into a minor fraction of  their original size. So powerful are the effects of a black hole, that no  ship may pass within two parsecs.
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  008F3     144  en    Harold  The High Council has found evidence that %s, the highest %s, has CHEATED!!!  Deal with this in a manner that befits the custom for your culture.
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  00984     217  en    Harold  Although your score is high enough to be considered amoung the greatest to  play Master Of Orion II, the High Council has decided to strip you of all  glory and accomplishment, hoping you will not CHEAT in the future!
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  00A5E      27  ?     Harold  NO NEW WEAPONS CAN BE ADDED
