HESTRNGS.LBX      0  00E60     192  en    Harold  After destroying the Guardian, you find an abandoned warship that was once commanded by the Last Orion, Loknar. On board Loknar's ship,  you find knowledge of the following technology:\x0A\x0A
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  00F1B     183  en    Harold  After destroying the Guardian, you rescue a mighty warship piloted by Loknar, the famous Antaran hunter. Loknar has agreed to share his knowledge of the following  technology:\x0A\x0A
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  00FCD     174  en    Harold  MAGNIFICIENT!!! You have achieved the HIGHEST score to date! Let it be known  that there are none better than %s, grandest champion of Master Of Orion II,  Battle At Antares!
HESTRNGS.LBX      0  0107C      91  en    Harold  Well done! %s is truly one of the best to ever play Master Of Orion II,  Battle At Antares!
