SKILDESC.LBX      1  00004      71  en            %s gives a %d%% chance of assassinating a random enemy agent each turn.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00103     113  en            %s increases the ground combat bonuses of all troops by %d, who may either be on a ship or stationed on a planet.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00202      88  en            %s increases diplomatic points by %d for all diplomatic negotiations with enemy empires.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00301     121  en            %s increases the restoration rate of a ship's shields by %d%%. In addition, the engineer repairs all damage after battle.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00400      51  en            %s reduces the pollution level of a planet by %d%%.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  004FF     108  en            %s increases the chance to recruit other officers and decreases the cost of hiring other officers by %d BCs.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  005FE      60  en            %s increases the amount of food grown on the colony by %d%%.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  006FD      68  en            %s increases offense and defense of all fighters in the fleet by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  007FC      51  en            %s increases the credit income of a colony by %d%%.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  008FB     124  en            %s relays instant knowledge of planet and star information and gives +%d in combat when battling space monsters and Antarans
SKILDESC.LBX      1  009FA      51  en            %s increases the defensive bonus of the ship by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00AF9     109  en            %s increases experience points by %d per turn for ALL ships. Only the BEST bonus for all instructors is used.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00BF8      57  en            %s increases the productivity of factory workers by %d%%.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00CF7      76  en            %s increases the population growth rate of all planets in the system by %d%%
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00DF6     111  en            %s is independently wealthy, does not require any upkeep cost while contributing %d BC to the empire each turn.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00EF5     153  en            %s allows all accompanying ships to ignore the movement restrictions of moving through a nebulae or a black hole and raises the speed of all ships by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  00FF4      47  en            %s increases the command rating of ships by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  010F3      48  en            %s increases the maximum damage of a ship by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  011F2      54  it            %s increases research points generated by %d per turn.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  012F1      56  en            %s increases the research generated by a colony by %d%%.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  013F0      89  en            %s increases the combat strength of a ship's marines by %d when boarded by enemy marines.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  014EF      51  en            %s increases the morale rating of a planet by %d%%.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  015EE      75  en            %s increases the spying bonus of all spies operating in alien empire by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  016ED      81  en            %s increases the initiative of all accompanying ships at the same location by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  017EC      81  en            %s increases the spying bonus of all defensive agents against enemy agents by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  018EB      58  en            %s increases the monetary bonus of trade agreements by %d.
SKILDESC.LBX      1  019EA      48  en            %s increases the attack bonus of the ship by %d.
